          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0627\u062d\u0635\u0644 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0647\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0646 \u0628\u064a\u0626\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0643\u0644\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u0644\u064a\u0629 (Claude \u0623\u0648 Cursor \u0623\u0648 Codex) \u0623\u0648 \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0633\u0648\u0627\u0642 Git/HTTPS \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0639\u064a\u062f\u0629."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beziehen Sie Skills aus lokalen Agent-Umgebungen (Claude, Cursor, Codex) oder aus entfernten Git/HTTPS-Marktpl\u00e4tzen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acquire skills from local agent harnesses (Claude, Cursor, Codex) or remote Git/HTTPS marketplaces."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obt\u00e9n habilidades desde entornos de agentes locales (Claude, Cursor, Codex) o desde marketplaces remotos Git/HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "R\u00e9cup\u00e9rez des comp\u00e9tences depuis des environnements d'agents locaux (Claude, Cursor, Codex) ou des places de march\u00e9 Git/HTTPS distantes."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e7\u05d1\u05dc \u05de\u05d9\u05d5\u05de\u05e0\u05d5\u05d9\u05d5\u05ea \u05de\u05e1\u05d1\u05d9\u05d1\u05d5\u05ea \u05e1\u05d5\u05db\u05df \u05de\u05e7\u05d5\u05de\u05d9\u05d5\u05ea (Claude, Cursor, Codex) \u05d0\u05d5 \u05de\u05de\u05e8\u05db\u05d6\u05d9 Git/HTTPS \u05de\u05e8\u05d5\u05d7\u05e7\u05d9\u05dd."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0928\u0940\u092f \u090f\u091c\u0947\u0902\u091f \u0939\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0928\u0947\u0938 (Claude, Cursor, Codex) \u092f\u093e \u0930\u093f\u092e\u094b\u091f Git/HTTPS \u092e\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0915\u0947\u091f\u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947\u0938 \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u093f\u0932 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dapatkan keterampilan dari lingkungan agen lokal (Claude, Cursor, Codex) atau dari marketplace Git/HTTPS jarak jauh."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acquisisci competenze da ambienti di agenti locali (Claude, Cursor, Codex) o da marketplace remoti Git/HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30eb\u306e\u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c8\u74b0\u5883 (Claude\u3001Cursor\u3001Codex) \u3084\u30ea\u30e2\u30fc\u30c8\u306e Git/HTTPS \u30de\u30fc\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30b9\u304b\u3089\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u3092\u53d6\u5f97\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub85c\uceec \uc5d0\uc774\uc804\ud2b8 \ud658\uacbd(Claude, Cursor, Codex) \ub610\ub294 \uc6d0\uaca9 Git/HTTPS \ub9c8\ucf13\ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc2a4\uc5d0\uc11c \uc2a4\ud0ac\uc744 \uac00\uc838\uc635\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haal skills op uit lokale agentomgevingen (Claude, Cursor, Codex) of uit externe Git/HTTPS-marktplaatsen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pobieraj umiej\u0119tno\u015bci z lokalnych \u015brodowisk agent\u00f3w (Claude, Cursor, Codex) lub ze zdalnych marketplace'\u00f3w Git/HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obtenha habilidades de ambientes de agentes locais (Claude, Cursor, Codex) ou de marketplaces remotos Git/HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0432\u044b\u043a\u0438 \u0438\u0437 \u043b\u043e\u043a\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0430\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u043e\u043a\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 (Claude, Cursor, Codex) \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0438\u0437 \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u043c\u0430\u0440\u043a\u0435\u0442\u043f\u043b\u0435\u0439\u0441\u043e\u0432 Git/HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "H\u00e4mta f\u00e4rdigheter fr\u00e5n lokala agentmilj\u00f6er (Claude, Cursor, Codex) eller fr\u00e5n fj\u00e4rrmarknadsplatser via Git/HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yerel arac\u0131 ortamlar\u0131ndan (Claude, Cursor, Codex) veya uzak Git/HTTPS pazarlar\u0131ndan beceri edinin."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041e\u0442\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0447\u043a\u0438 \u0437 \u043b\u043e\u043a\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u0430\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0441\u044c\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0449 (Claude, Cursor, Codex) \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0437 \u0432\u0456\u0434\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u043c\u0430\u0440\u043a\u0435\u0442\u043f\u043b\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0456\u0432 Git/HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L\u1ea5y k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng t\u1eeb m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng t\u00e1c nh\u00e2n c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 (Claude, Cursor, Codex) ho\u1eb7c t\u1eeb ch\u1ee3 Git/HTTPS t\u1eeb xa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ece\u672c\u5730\u4ee3\u7406\u73af\u5883 (Claude\u3001Cursor\u3001Codex) \u6216\u8fdc\u7a0b Git/HTTPS \u5e02\u573a\u83b7\u53d6\u6280\u80fd\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f9e\u672c\u6a5f\u4ee3\u7406\u74b0\u5883 (Claude\u3001Cursor\u3001Codex) \u6216\u9060\u7aef Git/HTTPS \u5e02\u96c6\u53d6\u5f97\u6280\u80fd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
