    "Manage project-specific MCP servers and import configs from codebase.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0623\u062f\u0631 \u062e\u0648\u0627\u062f\u0645 MCP \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639 \u0648\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0648\u0631\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0639\u062f\u0627\u062f\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0646 \u0642\u0627\u0639\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0641\u0631\u0629."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwalten Sie projektspezifische MCP-Server und importieren Sie Konfigurationen aus der Codebase."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manage project-specific MCP servers and import configs from codebase."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gestiona servidores MCP espec\u00edficos del proyecto e importa configuraciones desde el c\u00f3digo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00e9rez les serveurs MCP propres au projet et importez des configurations depuis le code."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e0\u05d4\u05dc \u05e9\u05e8\u05ea\u05d9 MCP \u05d9\u05d9\u05e2\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd \u05dc\u05e4\u05e8\u05d5\u05d9\u05e7\u05d8 \u05d5\u05d9\u05d9\u05d1\u05d0 \u05ea\u05e6\u05d5\u05e8\u05d5\u05ea \u05de\u05d1\u05e1\u05d9\u05e1 \u05d4\u05e7\u05d5\u05d3."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f-\u0935\u093f\u0936\u093f\u0937\u094d\u091f MCP \u0938\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0930 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092c\u0902\u0927\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u094b\u0921\u092c\u0947\u0938 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0949\u0928\u094d\u092b\u093c\u093f\u0917 \u0906\u092f\u093e\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kelola server MCP khusus proyek dan impor konfigurasi dari basis kode."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gestisci i server MCP specifici del progetto e importa le configurazioni dal codice."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u56fa\u6709\u306e MCP \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u3092\u7ba1\u7406\u3057\u3001\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u304b\u3089\u69cb\u6210\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\ubcc4 MCP \uc11c\ubc84\ub97c \uad00\ub9ac\ud558\uace0 \ucf54\ub4dc\ubca0\uc774\uc2a4\uc5d0\uc11c \uad6c\uc131\uc744 \uac00\uc838\uc635\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beheer projectspecifieke MCP-servers en importeer configuraties uit de codebase."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zarz\u0105dzaj serwerami MCP w\u0142a\u015bciwymi dla projektu i importuj konfiguracje z kodu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerencie servidores MCP espec\u00edficos do projeto e importe configura\u00e7\u00f5es do c\u00f3digo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430\u043c\u0438 MCP \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043a\u043e\u043d\u043a\u0440\u0435\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0430 \u0438 \u0438\u043c\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u0438\u0433\u0443\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438 \u0438\u0437 \u043a\u043e\u0434\u0430."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hantera projektspecifika MCP-servrar och importera konfigurationer fr\u00e5n kodbasen."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projeye \u00f6zg\u00fc MCP sunucular\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6netin ve yap\u0131land\u0131rmalar\u0131 kod taban\u0131ndan i\u00e7e aktar\u0131n."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041a\u0435\u0440\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430\u043c\u0438 MCP \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0454\u043a\u0442\u0443 \u0442\u0430 \u0456\u043c\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u0456\u0433\u0443\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0456\u0457 \u0437 \u043a\u043e\u0434\u0443."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7 MCP ri\u00eang cho d\u1ef1 \u00e1n v\u00e0 nh\u1eadp c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh t\u1eeb m\u00e3 ngu\u1ed3n."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7ba1\u7406\u9879\u76ee\u4e13\u5c5e\u7684 MCP \u670d\u52a1\u5668\uff0c\u5e76\u4ece\u4ee3\u7801\u5e93\u5bfc\u5165\u914d\u7f6e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7ba1\u7406\u5c08\u6848\u5c08\u5c6c\u7684 MCP \u4f3a\u670d\u5668\uff0c\u4e26\u5f9e\u7a0b\u5f0f\u78bc\u5eab\u532f\u5165\u7d44\u614b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage sources": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
