    "Pinned MLX variants with completed install gates. The first choice is sized for this Mac; the others are available when you want a different quality or disk tradeoff.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0645\u062a\u063a\u064a\u0631\u0627\u062a MLX \u0645\u062b\u0628\u062a\u0629 \u0627\u0643\u062a\u0645\u0644\u062a \u0641\u062d\u0648\u0635\u0627\u062a \u062a\u062b\u0628\u064a\u062a\u0647\u0627. \u0627\u0644\u062e\u064a\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644 \u0645\u0646\u0627\u0633\u0628 \u0644\u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0640 Mac\u060c \u0628\u064a\u0646\u0645\u0627 \u062a\u0648\u0641\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u064a\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062e\u0631\u0649 \u0645\u0648\u0627\u0632\u0646\u0629 \u0645\u062e\u062a\u0644\u0641\u0629 \u0628\u064a\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0648\u0645\u0633\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0635."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Angeheftete MLX-Varianten mit abgeschlossenen Installationsprufungen. Die erste Wahl ist fur diesen Mac dimensioniert; die anderen bieten unterschiedliche Qualitats- und Speicherkompromisse."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pinned MLX variants with completed install gates. The first choice is sized for this Mac; the others are available when you want a different quality or disk tradeoff."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Variantes MLX fijadas con las comprobaciones de instalacion completadas. La primera opcion esta dimensionada para este Mac; las demas ofrecen distintos compromisos de calidad y disco."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Variantes MLX epinglees dont les controles d'installation sont termines. Le premier choix est adapte a ce Mac; les autres offrent un compromis qualite-disque different."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d2\u05e8\u05e1\u05d0\u05d5\u05ea MLX \u05de\u05d5\u05e6\u05de\u05d3\u05d5\u05ea \u05e2\u05dd \u05d1\u05d3\u05d9\u05e7\u05d5\u05ea \u05d4\u05ea\u05e7\u05e0\u05d4 \u05e9\u05d4\u05d5\u05e9\u05dc\u05de\u05d5. \u05d4\u05d1\u05d7\u05d9\u05e8\u05d4 \u05d4\u05e8\u05d0\u05e9\u05d5\u05e0\u05d4 \u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d0\u05de\u05ea \u05dc-Mac \u05d4\u05d6\u05d4, \u05d5\u05d4\u05d0\u05d7\u05e8\u05d5\u05ea \u05de\u05e6\u05d9\u05e2\u05d5\u05ea \u05d0\u05d9\u05d6\u05d5\u05e0\u05d9\u05dd \u05e9\u05d5\u05e0\u05d9\u05dd \u05d1\u05d9\u05df \u05d0\u05d9\u05db\u05d5\u05ea \u05dc\u05e0\u05e4\u05d7 \u05d3\u05d9\u05e1\u05e7."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0907\u0902\u0938\u094d\u091f\u0949\u0932 \u091c\u093e\u0902\u091a \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u092a\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u0940 \u0917\u0908 MLX \u0935\u0948\u0930\u093f\u090f\u0902\u091f\u0964 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a \u0907\u0938 Mac \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0906\u0915\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u0939\u0948; \u092c\u093e\u0915\u0940 \u0917\u0941\u0923\u0935\u0924\u094d\u0924\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0921\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0915 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0932\u0917 \u0938\u092e\u091d\u094c\u0924\u0947 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varian MLX yang dipasangkan dengan pemeriksaan instalasi selesai. Pilihan pertama disesuaikan untuk Mac ini; lainnya menawarkan pertukaran kualitas dan ruang disk yang berbeda."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varianti MLX fissate con i controlli di installazione completati. La prima scelta e dimensionata per questo Mac; le altre offrono compromessi diversi tra qualita e spazio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u691c\u8a3c\u3092\u5b8c\u4e86\u3057\u305f\u56fa\u5b9aMLX\u30d0\u30ea\u30a2\u30f3\u30c8\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5148\u982d\u306e\u5019\u88dc\u306f\u3053\u306eMac\u5411\u3051\u306b\u30b5\u30a4\u30ba\u8abf\u6574\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4ed6\u306f\u54c1\u8cea\u3068\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30af\u5bb9\u91cf\u306e\u9055\u3046\u9078\u629e\u80a2\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc124\uce58 \uac80\uc0ac\ub97c \uc644\ub8cc\ud55c \uace0\uc815 MLX \ubcc0\ud615\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uccab \ubc88\uc9f8 \uc120\ud0dd\uc740 \uc774 Mac\uc5d0 \ub9de\uac8c \ud06c\uae30\uac00 \uc815\ud574\uc84c\uace0, \ub098\uba38\uc9c0\ub294 \ud488\uc9c8\uacfc \ub514\uc2a4\ud06c \uc0ac\uc6a9\ub7c9\uc758 \ub2e4\ub978 \uc808\ucda9\uc548\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vastgezette MLX-varianten met voltooide installatiecontroles. De eerste keuze is afgestemd op deze Mac; de andere bieden een andere balans tussen kwaliteit en schijfruimte."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przypiete warianty MLX z ukonczonymi testami instalacji. Pierwszy wybor jest dopasowany do tego Maca, a pozostale oferuja inne kompromisy jakosci i miejsca na dysku."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Variantes MLX fixadas com os testes de instalacao concluidos. A primeira opcao e dimensionada para este Mac; as outras oferecem diferentes trocas entre qualidade e disco."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zakreplennye varianty MLX s zavershennymi prover\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438 ustanovki. Pervyi variant podobr\u0430n dlya etogo Mac, ostalnye dayut drugoi balans kachestva i mesta."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastasta MLX-varianter med slutforda installationskontroller. Det forsta valet ar dimensionerat for denna Mac; de andra ger andra avvagningar mellan kvalitet och diskutrymme."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurulum kontrolleri tamamlanmis sabitlenmis MLX varyantlari. Ilk secenek bu Mac icin boyutlandirildi; digerleri farkli kalite ve disk dengeleri sunar."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043a\u0440\u0456\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0456 \u0432\u0430\u0440\u0456\u0430\u043d\u0442\u0438 MLX \u0456\u0437 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0456\u0440\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f. \u041f\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u0439 \u0432\u0430\u0440\u0456\u0430\u043d\u0442 \u043f\u0456\u0434\u0456\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043e \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0446\u044c\u043e\u0433\u043e Mac, \u0456\u043d\u0448\u0456 \u043c\u0430\u044e\u0442\u044c \u0456\u043d\u0448\u0438\u0439 \u0431\u0430\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0441 \u044f\u043a\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0456 \u0442\u0430 \u043c\u0456\u0441\u0446\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0434\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0443."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cac bien the MLX da ghim voi cac buoc cai dat da hoan tat. Lua chon dau tien vua voi Mac nay; cac lua chon khac co danh doi khac giua chat luong va dung luong dia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
