    "Drag across the waveform to select a range to keep or export.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0627\u0633\u062d\u0628 \u0639\u0628\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u062c\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u0648\u062a\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u062a\u062d\u062f\u064a\u062f \u0646\u0637\u0627\u0642 \u0644\u0644\u0627\u062d\u062a\u0641\u0627\u0638 \u0628\u0647 \u0623\u0648 \u062a\u0635\u062f\u064a\u0631\u0647."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ziehe \u00fcber die Wellenform, um einen Bereich zum Behalten oder Exportieren auszuw\u00e4hlen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag across the waveform to select a range to keep or export."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrastra sobre la forma de onda para seleccionar un rango que conservar o exportar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faites glisser sur la forme d'onde pour s\u00e9lectionner une plage \u00e0 conserver ou \u00e0 exporter."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d2\u05e8\u05d5\u05e8 \u05dc\u05d0\u05d5\u05e8\u05da \u05e6\u05d5\u05e8\u05ea \u05d4\u05d2\u05dc \u05db\u05d3\u05d9 \u05dc\u05d1\u05d7\u05d5\u05e8 \u05d8\u05d5\u05d5\u05d7 \u05dc\u05e9\u05de\u05d9\u05e8\u05d4 \u05d0\u05d5 \u05dc\u05d9\u05d9\u05e6\u05d5\u05d0."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0930\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u092f\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0930\u0947\u0902\u091c \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0928\u0947 \u0939\u0947\u0924\u0941 \u0935\u0947\u0935\u092b\u093c\u0949\u0930\u094d\u092e \u092a\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seret di sepanjang bentuk gelombang untuk memilih rentang yang akan disimpan atau diekspor."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trascina sulla forma d'onda per selezionare un intervallo da mantenere o esportare."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6ce2\u5f62\u3092\u30c9\u30e9\u30c3\u30b0\u3057\u3066\u3001\u6b8b\u3059\u7bc4\u56f2\u307e\u305f\u306f\u66f8\u304d\u51fa\u3059\u7bc4\u56f2\u3092\u9078\u629e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud30c\ud615\uc744 \uac00\ub85c\uc9c8\ub7ec \ub4dc\ub798\uadf8\ud558\uc5ec \uc720\uc9c0\ud558\uac70\ub098 \ub0b4\ubcf4\ub0bc \uad6c\uac04\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sleep over de golfvorm om een bereik te selecteren om te behouden of te exporteren."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przeci\u0105gnij po wykresie fali, aby zaznaczy\u0107 fragment do zachowania lub eksportu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arraste sobre a forma de onda para selecionar um trecho para manter ou exportar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u043e \u0432\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0432\u044b\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0444\u0440\u0430\u0433\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0441\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u044d\u043a\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0430."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dra \u00f6ver v\u00e5gformen f\u00f6r att markera ett intervall att beh\u00e5lla eller exportera."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saklamak veya d\u0131\u015fa aktarmak i\u00e7in bir aral\u0131k se\u00e7mek \u00fczere dalga bi\u00e7imi boyunca s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0456\u0442\u044c \u043f\u043e \u0445\u0432\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043e\u0432\u0456\u0439 \u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0456, \u0449\u043e\u0431 \u0432\u0438\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0444\u0440\u0430\u0433\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0437\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0435\u043a\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0443."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "K\u00e9o qua d\u1ea1ng s\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn \u0111o\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n gi\u1eef ho\u1eb7c xu\u1ea5t."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u6ce2\u5f62\u4e0a\u62d6\u52a8\u4ee5\u9009\u62e9\u8981\u4fdd\u7559\u6216\u5bfc\u51fa\u7684\u8303\u56f4\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u6ce2\u5f62\u4e0a\u62d6\u79fb\u4ee5\u9078\u53d6\u8981\u4fdd\u7559\u6216\u8f38\u51fa\u7684\u7bc4\u570d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
