            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Formen har inte kontrollerats: modellens manifest anger ingen dold storlek."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bi\u00e7im denetlenmedi: bu modelin bildirimi gizli boyut belirtmiyor."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0424\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0443 \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0456\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043e: \u043c\u0430\u043d\u0456\u0444\u0435\u0441\u0442 \u0446\u0456\u0454\u0457 \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0456 \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0443\u0454 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0445\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0440\u043e\u0437\u043c\u0456\u0440."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ch\u01b0a ki\u1ec3m tra h\u00ecnh d\u1ea1ng: t\u1ec7p k\u00ea khai c\u1ee7a m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng khai b\u00e1o k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc \u1ea9n."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
