    "Display bottom toolbar metrics as numeric text or live sparkline graphs": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0639\u0631\u0636 \u0645\u0642\u0627\u064a\u064a\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0631\u064a\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0641\u0644\u064a \u0643\u0646\u0635 \u0631\u0642\u0645\u064a \u0623\u0648 \u0631\u0633\u0648\u0645 \u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0634\u0631\u0629"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kennzahlen der unteren Leiste als Zahlen oder Live-Sparklines anzeigen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display bottom toolbar metrics as numeric text or live sparkline graphs"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mostrar las m\u00e9tricas de la barra inferior como n\u00fameros o gr\u00e1ficos en vivo"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les mesures de la barre inf\u00e9rieure en chiffres ou en mini-graphiques en direct"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05e6\u05d2\u05ea \u05de\u05d3\u05d3\u05d9 \u05e1\u05e8\u05d2\u05dc \u05d4\u05db\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05d4\u05ea\u05d7\u05ea\u05d5\u05df \u05db\u05d8\u05e7\u05e1\u05d8 \u05de\u05e1\u05e4\u05e8\u05d9 \u05d0\u05d5 \u05db\u05d2\u05e8\u05e4\u05d9\u05dd \u05d7\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u091f\u0942\u0932\u092c\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u091f\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0938 \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u092f\u093e \u0932\u093e\u0907\u0935 \u0938\u094d\u092a\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0915\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0928 \u0917\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092b\u093c \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u090f\u0902"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tampilkan metrik bilah bawah sebagai angka atau grafik sparkline langsung"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mostra le metriche della barra inferiore come numeri o grafici sparkline in tempo reale"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0b\u90e8\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u30d0\u30fc\u306e\u6307\u6a19\u3092\u6570\u5024\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u306e\u30b9\u30d1\u30fc\u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3067\u8868\u793a"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud558\ub2e8 \ub3c4\uad6c \ub9c9\ub300 \uc9c0\ud45c\ub97c \uc22b\uc790 \ub610\ub294 \uc2e4\uc2dc\uac04 \uc2a4\ud30c\ud06c\ub77c\uc778 \uadf8\ub798\ud504\ub85c \ud45c\uc2dc"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statistieken in de onderste balk tonen als getallen of live sparklines"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pokazuj wska\u017aniki dolnego paska jako liczby lub wykresy na \u017cywo"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exibir as m\u00e9tricas da barra inferior como n\u00fameros ou gr\u00e1ficos ao vivo"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043c\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u043d\u0438\u0436\u043d\u0435\u0439 \u043f\u0430\u043d\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u043b\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0438-\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0444\u0438\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Visa m\u00e4tv\u00e4rden i nedre f\u00e4ltet som siffror eller live-diagram"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alt ara\u00e7 \u00e7ubu\u011fu \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmlerini say\u0131 veya canl\u0131 mini grafik olarak g\u00f6ster"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0443\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u043c\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u043d\u0438\u0436\u043d\u044c\u043e\u0457 \u043f\u0430\u043d\u0435\u043b\u0456 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u043b\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u043c\u0456\u043d\u0456\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0444\u0456\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u thanh d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ed3 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c06\u5e95\u90e8\u5de5\u5177\u680f\u6307\u6807\u663e\u793a\u4e3a\u6570\u5b57\u6216\u5b9e\u65f6\u8ff7\u4f60\u56fe"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
