          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schreibt ausdr\u00fccklich ausgew\u00e4hlte private Daten in eine unverschl\u00fcsselte ZIP-Datei"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writes explicitly selected private data to a plaintext ZIP"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escribe los datos privados seleccionados expresamente en un ZIP sin cifrar"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c9crit les donn\u00e9es priv\u00e9es explicitement s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9es dans un ZIP non chiffr\u00e9"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05db\u05d5\u05ea\u05d1 \u05e0\u05ea\u05d5\u05e0\u05d9\u05dd \u05e4\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd \u05e9\u05e0\u05d1\u05d7\u05e8\u05d5 \u05d1\u05de\u05e4\u05d5\u05e8\u05e9 \u05dc\u05e7\u05d5\u05d1\u05e5 ZIP \u05dc\u05d0 \u05de\u05d5\u05e6\u05e4\u05df"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947 \u0917\u090f \u0928\u093f\u091c\u0940 \u0921\u0947\u091f\u093e \u0915\u094b \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u090f\u0928\u094d\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092a\u094d\u0936\u0928 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0940 ZIP \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0932\u093f\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menulis data pribadi yang dipilih secara eksplisit ke ZIP tanpa enkripsi"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scrive i dati privati selezionati esplicitamente in uno ZIP non cifrato"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u660e\u793a\u7684\u306b\u9078\u3093\u3060\u500b\u4eba\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u6697\u53f7\u5316\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044 ZIP \u306b\u66f8\u304d\u51fa\u3057\u307e\u3059"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uba85\uc2dc\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uc120\ud0dd\ud55c \uac1c\uc778 \ub370\uc774\ud130\ub97c \uc554\ud638\ud654\ub418\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc740 ZIP\uc5d0 \uae30\ub85d\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schrijft expliciet geselecteerde priv\u00e9gegevens naar een onversleutelde ZIP"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zapisuje wyra\u017anie wybrane dane prywatne do niezaszyfrowanego pliku ZIP"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grava os dados privados selecionados explicitamente em um ZIP sem criptografia"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0441\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u044f\u0432\u043d\u043e \u0432\u044b\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0432 \u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0444\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 ZIP"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skriver uttryckligen valda privata data till en okrypterad ZIP"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a se\u00e7ilen \u00f6zel verileri \u015fifrelenmemi\u015f bir ZIP'e yazar"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0443\u0454 \u044f\u0432\u043d\u043e \u0432\u0438\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0456 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u043d\u0456 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u0456 \u0432 \u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0444\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439 ZIP"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ghi d\u1eef li\u1ec7u ri\u00eang t\u01b0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ecdn r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0o t\u1ec7p ZIP kh\u00f4ng m\u00e3 h\u00f3a"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c06\u660e\u786e\u9009\u62e9\u7684\u79c1\u4eba\u6570\u636e\u5199\u5165\u672a\u52a0\u5bc6\u7684 ZIP"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c07\u660e\u78ba\u9078\u53d6\u7684\u79c1\u4eba\u8cc7\u6599\u5beb\u5165\u672a\u52a0\u5bc6\u7684 ZIP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
