    "Fans did not reach target RPM within 10 s; the pin may not be holding.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0644\u0645 \u062a\u0635\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0627\u0648\u062d \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0639\u062f\u062f \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u0647\u062f\u0641 \u062e\u0644\u0627\u0644 10 \u062b\u0648\u0627\u0646\u064d\u061b \u0642\u062f \u0644\u0627 \u064a\u0643\u0648\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062b\u0628\u064a\u062a \u0641\u0639\u0651\u0627\u0644\u064b\u0627."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die L\u00fcfter haben die Zieldrehzahl nicht innerhalb von 10 s erreicht; die Fixierung greift m\u00f6glicherweise nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fans did not reach target RPM within 10 s; the pin may not be holding."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los ventiladores no alcanzaron las RPM objetivo en 10 s; es posible que la fijaci\u00f3n no se mantenga."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les ventilateurs n'ont pas atteint le r\u00e9gime cible en 10 s ; le maintien forc\u00e9 ne tient peut-\u00eatre pas."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05de\u05d0\u05d5\u05d5\u05e8\u05e8\u05d9\u05dd \u05dc\u05d0 \u05d4\u05d2\u05d9\u05e2\u05d5 \u05dc\u05de\u05d4\u05d9\u05e8\u05d5\u05ea \u05d4\u05d9\u05e2\u05d3 (RPM) \u05d1\u05ea\u05d5\u05da 10 \u05e9\u05e0\u05d9\u05d5\u05ea; \u05d9\u05d9\u05ea\u05db\u05df \u05e9\u05d4\u05e7\u05d9\u05d1\u05d5\u05e2 \u05d0\u05d9\u05e0\u05d5 \u05de\u05d7\u05d6\u05d9\u05e7."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092a\u0902\u0916\u0947 10 \u0938\u0947\u0915\u0902\u0921 \u0915\u0947 \u092d\u0940\u0924\u0930 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f RPM \u0924\u0915 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u092a\u0939\u0941\u0901\u091a\u0947; \u0939\u094b \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0930 \u0917\u0924\u093f \u0932\u093e\u0917\u0942 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u094b \u0930\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u094b\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kipas tidak mencapai RPM target dalam 10 detik; penguncian mungkin tidak bertahan."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le ventole non hanno raggiunto gli RPM di destinazione entro 10 s; il blocco potrebbe non reggere."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u304c 10 \u79d2\u4ee5\u5185\u306b\u76ee\u6a19\u56de\u8ee2\u6570\u306b\u9054\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002\u56fa\u5b9a\u304c\u4fdd\u6301\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud32c\uc774 10\ucd08 \uc774\ub0b4\uc5d0 \ubaa9\ud45c RPM\uc5d0 \ub3c4\ub2ec\ud558\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uace0\uc815\uc774 \uc720\uc9c0\ub418\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc744 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De ventilatoren bereikten het doel-RPM niet binnen 10 s; de vastzetting houdt mogelijk geen stand."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wentylatory nie osi\u0105gn\u0119\u0142y docelowych obrot\u00f3w w ci\u0105gu 10 s; blokada mo\u017ce nie dzia\u0142a\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As ventoinhas n\u00e3o atingiram o RPM alvo em 10 s; a fixa\u00e7\u00e3o pode n\u00e3o estar se mantendo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u043b\u044f\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u044b\u0448\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0432\u044b\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442\u044b \u0437\u0430 10 \u0441; \u0444\u0438\u043a\u0441\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f, \u0432\u043e\u0437\u043c\u043e\u0436\u043d\u043e, \u043d\u0435 \u0443\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fl\u00e4ktarna n\u00e5dde inte m\u00e5lvarvtalet inom 10 s; l\u00e5sningen kanske inte h\u00e5ller."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fanlar 10 sn i\u00e7inde hedef RPM'e ula\u015fmad\u0131; sabitleme tutmuyor olabilir."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u043b\u044f\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u0439\u0448\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u0446\u0456\u043b\u044c\u043e\u0432\u0456 \u043e\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0438 \u0437\u0430 10 \u0441; \u0444\u0456\u043a\u0441\u0430\u0446\u0456\u044f, \u043c\u043e\u0436\u043b\u0438\u0432\u043e, \u043d\u0435 \u0443\u0442\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0443\u0454\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qu\u1ea1t kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t RPM m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau trong v\u00f2ng 10 gi\u00e2y; vi\u1ec7c c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy tr\u00ec."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u98ce\u6247\u672a\u5728 10 \u79d2\u5185\u8fbe\u5230\u76ee\u6807\u8f6c\u901f\uff1b\u56fa\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u672a\u751f\u6548\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u98a8\u6247\u672a\u5728 10 \u79d2\u5167\u9054\u5230\u76ee\u6a19\u8f49\u901f\uff1b\u56fa\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u672a\u751f\u6548\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish or cancel the running work before switching profiles.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0623\u0643\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0627\u0631\u064a \u0623\u0648 \u0623\u0644\u063a\u0647 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u062a\u0628\u062f\u064a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schlie\u00dfen Sie die laufende Arbeit ab oder brechen Sie sie ab, bevor Sie das Profil wechseln."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finish or cancel the running work before switching profiles."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Termina o cancela el trabajo en curso antes de cambiar de perfil."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminez ou annulez le travail en cours avant de changer de profil."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e1\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd \u05d0\u05d5 \u05d1\u05d8\u05dc \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05d5\u05d3\u05d4 \u05d4\u05e4\u05e2\u05d9\u05dc\u05d4 \u05dc\u05e4\u05e0\u05d9 \u05d4\u05d7\u05dc\u05e4\u05ea \u05d4\u05e4\u05e8\u05d5\u05e4\u05d9\u05dc."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u092b\u093c\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u092c\u0926\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u091a\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0915\u093e\u092e \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 \u092f\u093e \u0930\u0926\u094d\u0926 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selesaikan atau batalkan pekerjaan yang sedang berjalan sebelum berganti profil."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completa o annulla il lavoro in corso prima di cambiare profilo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30d7\u30ed\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u5207\u308a\u66ff\u3048\u308b\u524d\u306b\u3001\u5b9f\u884c\u4e2d\u306e\u51e6\u7406\u3092\u5b8c\u4e86\u3059\u308b\u304b\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30bb\u30eb\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud504\ub85c\ud544\uc744 \uc804\ud658\ud558\uae30 \uc804\uc5d0 \uc2e4\ud589 \uc911\uc778 \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \uc644\ub8cc\ud558\uac70\ub098 \ucde8\uc18c\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rond het lopende werk af of annuleer het voordat je van profiel wisselt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zako\u0144cz lub anuluj trwaj\u0105c\u0105 prac\u0119 przed zmian\u0105 profilu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conclua ou cancele o trabalho em andamento antes de trocar de perfil."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u0442\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u043a\u0443\u0449\u0443\u044e \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0443 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0441\u043c\u0435\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0444\u0438\u043b\u044f."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slutf\u00f6r eller avbryt p\u00e5g\u00e5ende arbete innan du byter profil."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Profili de\u011fi\u015ftirmeden \u00f6nce \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan i\u015fi tamamlay\u0131n veya iptal edin."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0456\u0442\u044c \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0441\u043a\u0430\u0441\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0443 \u0440\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0443 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0437\u043c\u0456\u043d\u043e\u044e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0444\u0456\u043b\u044e."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "H\u00e3y ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t ho\u1eb7c h\u1ee7y c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c \u0111ang ch\u1ea1y tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi chuy\u1ec3n h\u1ed3 s\u01a1."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5207\u6362\u914d\u7f6e\u6863\u6848\u524d\uff0c\u8bf7\u5148\u5b8c\u6210\u6216\u53d6\u6d88\u6b63\u5728\u8fdb\u884c\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5207\u63db\u8a2d\u5b9a\u6a94\u524d\uff0c\u8acb\u5148\u5b8c\u6210\u6216\u53d6\u6d88\u6b63\u5728\u9032\u884c\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish or stop the current turn before switching models.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0623\u0643\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0627\u0644\u064a \u0623\u0648 \u0623\u0648\u0642\u0641\u0647 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u062a\u0628\u062f\u064a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0627\u0630\u062c."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schlie\u00dfen Sie die aktuelle Runde ab oder stoppen Sie sie, bevor Sie das Modell wechseln."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finish or stop the current turn before switching models."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Termina o det\u00e9n el turno actual antes de cambiar de modelo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminez ou arr\u00eatez le tour en cours avant de changer de mod\u00e8le."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e1\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd \u05d0\u05d5 \u05e2\u05e6\u05d5\u05e8 \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05ea\u05d5\u05e8 \u05d4\u05e0\u05d5\u05db\u05d7\u05d9 \u05dc\u05e4\u05e0\u05d9 \u05d4\u05d7\u05dc\u05e4\u05ea \u05de\u05d5\u05d3\u05dc."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0949\u0921\u0932 \u092c\u0926\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u092e\u094c\u091c\u0942\u0926\u093e \u091f\u0930\u094d\u0928 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 \u092f\u093e \u0930\u094b\u0915\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selesaikan atau hentikan giliran saat ini sebelum mengganti model."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completa o interrompi il turno in corso prima di cambiare modello."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3092\u5207\u308a\u66ff\u3048\u308b\u524d\u306b\u3001\u73fe\u5728\u306e\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u5b8c\u4e86\u3059\u308b\u304b\u505c\u6b62\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubaa8\ub378\uc744 \uc804\ud658\ud558\uae30 \uc804\uc5d0 \ud604\uc7ac \ud134\uc744 \uc644\ub8cc\ud558\uac70\ub098 \uc911\uc9c0\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rond de huidige beurt af of stop deze voordat je van model wisselt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zako\u0144cz lub zatrzymaj bie\u017c\u0105c\u0105 tur\u0119 przed zmian\u0105 modelu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conclua ou interrompa o turno atual antes de trocar de modelo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u043a\u0443\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0445\u043e\u0434 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0441\u043c\u0435\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slutf\u00f6r eller stoppa den p\u00e5g\u00e5ende turen innan du byter modell."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model de\u011fi\u015ftirmeden \u00f6nce ge\u00e7erli turu tamamlay\u0131n veya durdurun."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0456\u0442\u044c \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0437\u0443\u043f\u0438\u043d\u0456\u0442\u044c \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0445\u0456\u0434 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0437\u043c\u0456\u043d\u043e\u044e \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0456."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "H\u00e3y ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t ho\u1eb7c d\u1eebng l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi chuy\u1ec3n m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5148\u5b8c\u6210\u6216\u505c\u6b62\u5f53\u524d\u8f6e\u6b21\uff0c\u518d\u5207\u6362\u6a21\u578b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5148\u5b8c\u6210\u6216\u505c\u6b62\u76ee\u524d\u56de\u5408\uff0c\u518d\u5207\u63db\u6a21\u578b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
