    "Give the question: /btw What did we decide about retries?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0623\u062f\u062e\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0624\u0627\u0644: /btw \u0645\u0627\u0630\u0627 \u0642\u0631\u0631\u0646\u0627 \u0628\u0634\u0623\u0646 \u0625\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u0627\u0648\u0644\u0627\u062a\u061f"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geben Sie die Frage an: /btw Was haben wir zu Wiederholungsversuchen entschieden?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Give the question: /btw What did we decide about retries?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escribe la pregunta: /btw \u00bfQu\u00e9 decidimos sobre los reintentos?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indiquez la question : /btw Qu'avons-nous d\u00e9cid\u00e9 pour les nouvelles tentatives ?"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05db\u05ea\u05d5\u05d1 \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05e9\u05d0\u05dc\u05d4: /btw \u05de\u05d4 \u05d4\u05d7\u05dc\u05d8\u05e0\u05d5 \u05dc\u05d2\u05d1\u05d9 \u05e0\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05d5\u05e0\u05d5\u05ea \u05d7\u05d5\u05d6\u05e8\u05d9\u05dd?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092a\u094d\u0930\u0936\u094d\u0928 \u0932\u093f\u0916\u0947\u0902: /btw \u0939\u092e\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0941\u0928\u0903 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092f\u093e\u0938\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0924\u092f \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0925\u093e?"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tulis pertanyaannya: /btw Apa keputusan kita soal percobaan ulang?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scrivi la domanda: /btw Cosa avevamo deciso sui nuovi tentativi?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8cea\u554f\u3092\u5165\u529b\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044: /btw \u30ea\u30c8\u30e9\u30a4\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u4f55\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc9c8\ubb38\uc744 \uc785\ub825\ud558\uc138\uc694: /btw \uc7ac\uc2dc\ub3c4\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc744 \uacb0\uc815\ud588\ub098\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geef de vraag op: /btw Wat hebben we besloten over nieuwe pogingen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podaj pytanie: /btw Co ustalili\u015bmy w sprawie ponownych pr\u00f3b?"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escreva a pergunta: /btw O que decidimos sobre as novas tentativas?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441: /btw \u0427\u0442\u043e \u043c\u044b \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0447\u0451\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u043f\u043e\u043f\u044b\u0442\u043e\u043a?"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skriv fr\u00e5gan: /btw Vad best\u00e4mde vi om nya f\u00f6rs\u00f6k?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soruyu yaz\u0131n: /btw Yeniden denemeler hakk\u0131nda ne karar vermi\u015ftik?"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f: /btw \u0429\u043e \u043c\u0438 \u0432\u0438\u0440\u0456\u0448\u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0449\u043e\u0434\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u0441\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431?"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nh\u1eadp c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi: /btw Ch\u00fang ta \u0111\u00e3 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh g\u00ec v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c th\u1eed l\u1ea1i?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u8f93\u5165\u95ee\u9898\uff1a/btw \u5173\u4e8e\u91cd\u8bd5\u6211\u4eec\u662f\u600e\u4e48\u51b3\u5b9a\u7684\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u8f38\u5165\u554f\u984c\uff1a/btw \u95dc\u65bc\u91cd\u8a66\u6211\u5011\u662f\u600e\u9ebc\u6c7a\u5b9a\u7684\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
