    "Pick a project with a folder first: /diff works on its git repository.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0627\u062e\u062a\u0631 \u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639\u064b\u0627 \u064a\u062d\u062a\u0648\u064a \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u062c\u0644\u062f \u0623\u0648\u0644\u064b\u0627: \u064a\u0639\u0645\u0644 /diff \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u0633\u062a\u0648\u062f\u0639 git \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635 \u0628\u0647."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W\u00e4hlen Sie zuerst ein Projekt mit einem Ordner: /diff arbeitet mit dessen Git-Repository."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a project with a folder first: /diff works on its git repository."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero elige un proyecto con una carpeta: /diff funciona sobre su repositorio git."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez d'abord un projet avec un dossier : /diff agit sur son d\u00e9p\u00f4t git."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d1\u05d7\u05e8 \u05ea\u05d7\u05d9\u05dc\u05d4 \u05e4\u05e8\u05d5\u05d9\u05e7\u05d8 \u05e2\u05dd \u05ea\u05d9\u05e7\u05d9\u05d9\u05d4: /diff \u05e4\u05d5\u05e2\u05dc \u05e2\u05dc \u05de\u05d0\u05d2\u05e8 \u05d4-git \u05e9\u05dc\u05d5."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0932\u094d\u0921\u0930 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902: /diff \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0940 git \u0930\u093f\u092a\u0949\u091c\u093c\u093f\u091f\u0930\u0940 \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pilih proyek dengan folder terlebih dahulu: /diff bekerja pada repositori git-nya."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scegli prima un progetto con una cartella: /diff opera sul suo repository git."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5148\u306b\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u306e\u3042\u308b\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u3092\u9078\u629e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002/diff \u306f\u305d\u306e git \u30ea\u30dd\u30b8\u30c8\u30ea\u3067\u52d5\u4f5c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uba3c\uc800 \ud3f4\ub354\uac00 \uc788\ub294 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\ub97c \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694. /diff \uba85\ub839\uc740 \ud574\ub2f9 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\uc758 git \ub9ac\ud3ec\uc9c0\ud1a0\ub9ac\uc5d0\uc11c \uc791\ub3d9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kies eerst een project met een map: /diff werkt op de git-repository ervan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Najpierw wybierz projekt z folderem: /diff dzia\u0142a na jego repozytorium git."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolha primeiro um projeto com uma pasta: /diff funciona no reposit\u00f3rio git dele."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u0430 \u0432\u044b\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u0441 \u043f\u0430\u043f\u043a\u043e\u0439: /diff \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0441 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0440\u0435\u043f\u043e\u0437\u0438\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0435\u043c git."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V\u00e4lj f\u00f6rst ett projekt med en mapp: /diff arbetar i dess git-repo."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
