            "value": "TurboSpark \u0915\u094b \u092a\u0939\u0941\u0901\u091a \u0926\u0947\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0939\u094b\u092e \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0932\u094d\u0921\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pilih folder rumah Anda untuk memberi TurboSpark akses."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seleziona la cartella Inizio per concedere l'accesso a TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TurboSpark \u306b\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u3092\u8a31\u53ef\u3059\u308b\u306b\u306f\u3001\u30db\u30fc\u30e0\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u3092\u9078\u629e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TurboSpark\uc5d0 \uc811\uadfc \uad8c\ud55c\uc744 \ubd80\uc5ec\ud558\ub824\uba74 \ud648 \ud3f4\ub354\ub97c \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selecteer je thuismap om TurboSpark toegang te geven."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wybierz katalog domowy, aby przyzna\u0107 TurboSpark dost\u0119p."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selecione sua pasta de in\u00edcio para conceder acesso ao TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u044b\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0448\u043d\u044e\u044e \u043f\u0430\u043f\u043a\u0443, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044c TurboSpark \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V\u00e4lj din hemmapp f\u00f6r att ge TurboSpark \u00e5tkomst."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TurboSpark'a eri\u015fim izni vermek i\u00e7in ana klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcz\u00fc se\u00e7in."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0438\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0456\u0442\u044c \u0434\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0448\u043d\u044e \u043f\u0430\u043f\u043a\u0443, \u0449\u043e\u0431 \u043d\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0438 TurboSpark \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ch\u1ecdn th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea5p quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp cho TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9009\u62e9\u4f60\u7684\u4e2a\u4eba\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\uff0c\u4ee5\u6388\u4e88 TurboSpark \u8bbf\u95ee\u6743\u9650\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9078\u64c7\u4f60\u7684\u500b\u4eba\u5c08\u5c6c\u8cc7\u6599\u593e\uff0c\u4ee5\u6388\u6b0a TurboSpark \u5b58\u53d6\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
