    "thermalforge %@ failed. Is the ThermalForge daemon running? Install it once with: sudo thermalforge install": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0641\u0634\u0644 thermalforge %@. \u0647\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0631\u0646\u0627\u0645\u062c \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0641\u064a ThermalForge \u0642\u064a\u062f \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0634\u063a\u064a\u0644\u061f \u062b\u0628\u0651\u062a\u0647 \u0645\u0631\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0627\u0645: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ ist fehlgeschlagen. L\u00e4uft der ThermalForge-Daemon? Installieren Sie ihn einmalig mit: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ failed. Is the ThermalForge daemon running? Install it once with: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ fall\u00f3. \u00bfSe est\u00e1 ejecutando el daemon de ThermalForge? Inst\u00e1lalo una vez con: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ a \u00e9chou\u00e9. Le daemon ThermalForge est-il en cours d'ex\u00e9cution ? Installez-le une fois avec : sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ \u05e0\u05db\u05e9\u05dc. \u05d4\u05d0\u05dd \u05d4-daemon \u05e9\u05dc ThermalForge \u05e4\u05d5\u05e2\u05dc? \u05d4\u05ea\u05e7\u05df \u05d0\u05d5\u05ea\u05d5 \u05e4\u05e2\u05dd \u05d0\u05d7\u05ea \u05d1\u05d0\u05de\u05e6\u05e2\u05d5\u05ea: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ \u0935\u093f\u092b\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u093e\u0964 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e ThermalForge \u0921\u0947\u092e\u0928 \u091a\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948? \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u092c\u093e\u0930 \u0907\u0938 \u0915\u092e\u093e\u0902\u0921 \u0938\u0947 \u0907\u0902\u0938\u094d\u091f\u0949\u0932 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ gagal. Apakah daemon ThermalForge sedang berjalan? Instal sekali dengan: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "thermalforge %@ non riuscito. Il daemon ThermalForge \u00e8 in esecuzione? Installalo una volta con: sudo thermalforge install"
          }
