            "value": "\u5df2\u5c07\u300c%@\u300d\u5b89\u88dd\u5230%@\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed by Claude Code and managed read-only here. Removing it only clears TurboSpark's enable record.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u062b\u0628\u0651\u062a\u0647 Claude Code \u0648\u064a\u064f\u062f\u0627\u0631 \u0647\u0646\u0627 \u0644\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0621\u0629 \u0641\u0642\u0637. \u0625\u0632\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0647 \u062a\u0645\u0633\u062d \u0641\u0642\u0637 \u0633\u062c\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0641\u0639\u064a\u0644 \u0641\u064a TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von Claude Code installiert und hier schreibgesch\u00fctzt verwaltet. Beim Entfernen wird nur der Aktivierungseintrag von TurboSpark gel\u00f6scht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installed by Claude Code and managed read-only here. Removing it only clears TurboSpark's enable record."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalado por Claude Code y gestionado aqu\u00ed en solo lectura. Quitarlo solo borra el registro de activaci\u00f3n de TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install\u00e9 par Claude Code et g\u00e9r\u00e9 ici en lecture seule. Le supprimer efface uniquement l\u2019enregistrement d\u2019activation de TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05d5\u05ea\u05e7\u05df \u05e2\u05dc \u05d9\u05d3\u05d9 Claude Code \u05d5\u05de\u05e0\u05d5\u05d4\u05dc \u05db\u05d0\u05df \u05dc\u05e7\u05e8\u05d9\u05d0\u05d4 \u05d1\u05dc\u05d1\u05d3. \u05d4\u05e1\u05e8\u05ea\u05d5 \u05de\u05d5\u05d7\u05e7\u05ea \u05e8\u05e7 \u05d0\u05ea \u05e8\u05e9\u05d5\u05de\u05ea \u05d4\u05d4\u05e4\u05e2\u05dc\u05d4 \u05e9\u05dc TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0907\u0902\u0938\u094d\u091f\u0949\u0932 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u092f\u0939\u093e\u0901 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932-\u092a\u0922\u093c\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092c\u0902\u0927\u093f\u0924\u0964 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0939\u091f\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 TurboSpark \u0915\u093e \u0938\u0915\u094d\u0937\u092e \u0930\u093f\u0915\u0949\u0930\u094d\u0921 \u0938\u093e\u092b\u093c \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dipasang oleh Claude Code dan dikelola hanya-baca di sini. Menghapusnya hanya menghapus catatan aktivasi TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installato da Claude Code e gestito qui in sola lettura. Rimuoverlo cancella solo il record di attivazione di TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code \u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3055\u308c\u3001\u3053\u3053\u3067\u306f\u8aad\u307f\u53d6\u308a\u5c02\u7528\u3067\u7ba1\u7406\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u524a\u9664\u3057\u3066\u3082 TurboSpark \u306e\u6709\u52b9\u5316\u8a18\u9332\u304c\u6d88\u3048\u308b\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code\uac00 \uc124\uce58\ud588\uc73c\uba70 \uc5ec\uae30\uc11c\ub294 \uc77d\uae30 \uc804\uc6a9\uc73c\ub85c \uad00\ub9ac\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc81c\uac70\ud558\uba74 TurboSpark\uc758 \ud65c\uc131\ud654 \uae30\ub85d\ub9cc \uc9c0\uc6cc\uc9d1\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ge\u00efnstalleerd door Claude Code en hier alleen-lezen beheerd. Verwijderen wist alleen de activeringsregistratie van TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zainstalowane przez Claude Code i zarz\u0105dzane tutaj tylko do odczytu. Usuni\u0119cie czy\u015bci jedynie wpis w\u0142\u0105czenia w TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalado pelo Claude Code e gerenciado aqui somente para leitura. Remov\u00ea-lo apenas apaga o registro de ativa\u00e7\u00e3o do TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043e Claude Code \u0438 \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0437\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044c \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0447\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f. \u0423\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043b\u0438\u0448\u044c \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0441\u044c \u043e \u0432\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438 \u0432 TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installerat av Claude Code och hanteras h\u00e4r som skrivskyddat. Att ta bort det rensar bara TurboSparks aktiveringspost."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code taraf\u0131ndan kuruldu ve burada salt okunur olarak y\u00f6netiliyor. Kald\u0131rmak yaln\u0131zca TurboSpark'\u0131n etkinle\u015ftirme kayd\u0131n\u0131 siler."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043e Claude Code \u0456 \u043a\u0435\u0440\u0443\u0454\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0442\u0443\u0442 \u043b\u0438\u0448\u0435 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f. \u0412\u0438\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0454 \u043b\u0438\u0448\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0441 \u043f\u0440\u043e \u0432\u0432\u0456\u043c\u043a\u043d\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0432 TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do Claude Code c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecdc t\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y. G\u1ee1 b\u1ecf ch\u1ec9 x\u00f3a b\u1ea3n ghi b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a TurboSpark."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7531 Claude Code \u5b89\u88c5\uff0c\u6b64\u5904\u4ec5\u4ee5\u53ea\u8bfb\u65b9\u5f0f\u7ba1\u7406\u3002\u79fb\u9664\u5b83\u53ea\u4f1a\u6e05\u9664 TurboSpark \u7684\u542f\u7528\u8bb0\u5f55\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7531 Claude Code \u5b89\u88dd\uff0c\u6b64\u8655\u50c5\u4ee5\u552f\u8b80\u65b9\u5f0f\u7ba1\u7406\u3002\u79fb\u9664\u5b83\u53ea\u6703\u6e05\u9664 TurboSpark \u7684\u555f\u7528\u8a18\u9304\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issues found while scanning hook config files: %lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0645\u0634\u0643\u0644\u0627\u062a \u0639\u064f\u062b\u0631 \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647\u0627 \u0623\u062b\u0646\u0627\u0621 \u0641\u062d\u0635 \u0645\u0644\u0641\u0627\u062a \u0625\u0639\u062f\u0627\u062f \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0637\u0627\u0641\u0627\u062a: %lld"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probleme beim Durchsuchen der Hook-Konfigurationsdateien: %lld"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Issues found while scanning hook config files: %lld"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problemas encontrados al analizar los archivos de configuraci\u00f3n de ganchos: %lld"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probl\u00e8mes d\u00e9tect\u00e9s lors de l\u2019analyse des fichiers de configuration des hooks : %lld"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d1\u05e2\u05d9\u05d5\u05ea \u05e9\u05e0\u05de\u05e6\u05d0\u05d5 \u05d1\u05e1\u05e8\u05d9\u05e7\u05ea \u05e7\u05d5\u05d1\u05e6\u05d9 \u05d4\u05ea\u05e6\u05d5\u05e8\u05d4 \u05e9\u05dc \u05d4\u05d4\u05d5\u05e7\u05d9\u05dd: %lld"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0939\u0941\u0915 \u0915\u0949\u0928\u094d\u092b\u093c\u093f\u0917 \u092b\u093c\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u0948\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0901: %lld"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masalah yang ditemukan saat memindai berkas konfigurasi hook: %lld"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problemi trovati durante l\u2019analisi dei file di configurazione degli hook: %lld"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30d5\u30c3\u30af\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u306e\u30b9\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u4e2d\u306b\u898b\u3064\u304b\u3063\u305f\u554f\u984c: %lld"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud6c5 \uc124\uc815 \ud30c\uc77c\uc744 \uac80\uc0ac\ud558\ub294 \uc911 \ubc1c\uacac\ub41c \ubb38\uc81c: %lld"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problemen gevonden bij het scannen van hookconfiguratiebestanden: %lld"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problemy wykryte podczas skanowania plik\u00f3w konfiguracji hook\u00f3w: %lld"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problemas encontrados ao verificar os arquivos de configura\u00e7\u00e3o de hooks: %lld"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u044b \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u0441\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0438 \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u043e\u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u0438\u0433\u0443\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438 \u0445\u0443\u043a\u043e\u0432: %lld"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problem som hittades vid genoms\u00f6kning av hookkonfigurationsfiler: %lld"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kanca yap\u0131land\u0131rma dosyalar\u0131 taran\u0131rken bulunan sorunlar: %lld"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u0438 \u043f\u0456\u0434 \u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0441\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u0456\u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u0456\u0433\u0443\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0456\u0457 \u0445\u0443\u043a\u0456\u0432: %lld"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S\u1ef1 c\u1ed1 ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n khi qu\u00e9t t\u1ec7p c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh hook: %lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
