    "Schedule a task for me. When: every weekday at 9 AM. What to do: ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u062c\u062f\u0648\u0644 \u0644\u064a \u0645\u0647\u0645\u0629. \u0645\u062a\u0649: \u0643\u0644 \u064a\u0648\u0645 \u0639\u0645\u0644 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0627\u0639\u0629 9 \u0635\u0628\u0627\u062d\u064b\u0627. \u0645\u0627\u0630\u0627 \u0623\u0641\u0639\u0644: "
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plane eine Aufgabe f\u00fcr mich. Wann: jeden Werktag um 9 Uhr. Was zu tun ist: "
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schedule a task for me. When: every weekday at 9 AM. What to do: "
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Progr\u00e1mame una tarea. Cu\u00e1ndo: cada d\u00eda laborable a las 9:00. Qu\u00e9 hacer: "
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Planifie une t\u00e2che pour moi. Quand : chaque jour ouvr\u00e9 \u00e0 9 h. Quoi faire : "
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05ea\u05d6\u05de\u05df \u05dc\u05d9 \u05de\u05e9\u05d9\u05de\u05d4. \u05de\u05ea\u05d9: \u05d1\u05db\u05dc \u05d9\u05d5\u05dd \u05d7\u05d5\u05dc \u05d1\u05e9\u05e2\u05d4 9:00. \u05de\u05d4 \u05dc\u05e2\u05e9\u05d5\u05ea: "
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0936\u0947\u0921\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0932 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0915\u092c: \u0939\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f\u0926\u093f\u0935\u0938 \u0938\u0941\u092c\u0939 9 \u092c\u091c\u0947\u0964 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0939\u0948: "
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jadwalkan tugas untuk saya. Kapan: setiap hari kerja pukul 09.00. Yang dilakukan: "
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pianifica un\u2019attivit\u00e0 per me. Quando: ogni giorno feriale alle 9. Cosa fare: "
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u3092\u30b9\u30b1\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u3044\u3064: \u5e73\u65e5\u306e\u6bce\u671d 9 \u6642\u3002\u5185\u5bb9: "
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \uc608\uc57d\ud574 \uc918. \uc5b8\uc81c: \ud3c9\uc77c \uc624\uc804 9\uc2dc\ub9c8\ub2e4. \ud560 \uc77c: "
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plan een taak voor me. Wanneer: elke werkdag om 9 uur. Wat te doen: "
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaplanuj dla mnie zadanie. Kiedy: w ka\u017cdy dzie\u0144 roboczy o 9:00. Co zrobi\u0107: "
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agende uma tarefa para mim. Quando: todo dia \u00fatil \u00e0s 9h. O que fazer: "
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0439 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0443. \u041a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430: \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u044b\u0439 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0432 9:00. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c: "
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schemal\u00e4gg en uppgift \u00e5t mig. N\u00e4r: varje vardag kl. 9. Vad som ska g\u00f6ras: "
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benim i\u00e7in bir g\u00f6rev zamanla. Ne zaman: her hafta i\u00e7i saat 09.00'da. Ne yap\u0131lacak: "
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0443\u0439 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f. \u041a\u043e\u043b\u0438: \u0449\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0434\u043d\u044f \u043e 9:00. \u0429\u043e \u0437\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0438\u0442\u0438: "
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "H\u00e3y l\u00ean l\u1ecbch m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c v\u1ee5 cho t\u00f4i. Khi n\u00e0o: 9 gi\u1edd s\u00e1ng m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y trong tu\u1ea7n. Vi\u1ec7c c\u1ea7n l\u00e0m: "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
