    "Mixture-of-Experts: streams routed experts via slot cache into ~2 GB RAM": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u062e\u0644\u064a\u0637 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0621: \u064a\u0628\u062b \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u062c\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0629 \u0639\u0628\u0631 \u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631\u0629 \u062e\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0624\u0642\u062a\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0646\u062d\u0648 2 \u063a\u064a\u063a\u0627\u0628\u0627\u064a\u062a \u0645\u0646 RAM"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: streamt geroutete Experten \u00fcber den Slot-Cache in ~2 GB RAM"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: streams routed experts via slot cache into ~2 GB RAM"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mezcla de expertos: transmite los expertos enrutados mediante la cach\u00e9 de ranuras en ~2 GB de RAM"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M\u00e9lange d\u2019experts : diffuse les experts rout\u00e9s via le cache d\u2019emplacements dans ~2 Go de RAM"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05ea\u05e2\u05e8\u05d5\u05d1\u05ea \u05de\u05d5\u05de\u05d7\u05d9\u05dd: \u05de\u05d6\u05e8\u05d9\u05dd \u05de\u05d5\u05de\u05d7\u05d9\u05dd \u05de\u05e0\u05d5\u05ea\u05d1\u05d9\u05dd \u05d3\u05e8\u05da \u05de\u05d8\u05de\u05d5\u05df \u05d7\u05e8\u05d9\u05e6\u05d9\u05dd \u05dc\u05ea\u05d5\u05da ~2 GB RAM"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0938\u091a\u0930-\u0911\u092b\u093c-\u090f\u0915\u094d\u0938\u092a\u0930\u094d\u091f\u094d\u0938: \u0930\u0942\u091f \u0915\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u090f\u0915\u094d\u0938\u092a\u0930\u094d\u091f \u0915\u094b \u0938\u094d\u0932\u0949\u091f \u0915\u0948\u0936 \u0915\u0947 \u091c\u093c\u0930\u093f\u090f ~2 GB RAM \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094d\u091f\u094d\u0930\u0940\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: mengalirkan pakar yang dirutekan lewat cache slot ke ~2 GB RAM"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: trasmette gli esperti instradati tramite la cache di slot in ~2 GB di RAM"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: \u30eb\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30a8\u30ad\u30b9\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u30b9\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8\u30ad\u30e3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u7d042 GB\u306eRAM\u306b\u30b9\u30c8\u30ea\u30fc\u30df\u30f3\u30b0"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: \ub77c\uc6b0\ud305\ub41c \uc804\ubb38\uac00\ub97c \uc2ac\ub86f \uce90\uc2dc\ub97c \ud1b5\ud574 ~2GB RAM\uc73c\ub85c \uc2a4\ud2b8\ub9ac\ubc0d"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: streamt gerouteerde experts via de slotcache in ~2 GB RAM"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: strumieniuje kierowanych ekspert\u00f3w przez pami\u0119\u0107 slot\u00f3w do ~2 GB RAM"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: transmite os especialistas roteados pelo cache de slots em ~2 GB de RAM"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043c\u0435\u0441\u044c \u044d\u043a\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0440\u0442\u043e\u0432: \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043c\u0430\u0440\u0448\u0440\u0443\u0442\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u043c\u044b\u0445 \u044d\u043a\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0440\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u043a\u044d\u0448 \u0441\u043b\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u0432 ~2 \u0413\u0411 \u041e\u0417\u0423"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixture-of-Experts: str\u00f6mmar routade experter via platscachen in i ~2 GB RAM"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uzman Kar\u0131\u015f\u0131m\u0131: y\u00f6nlendirilen uzmanlar\u0131 yuva \u00f6nbelle\u011fi \u00fczerinden ~2 GB RAM\u2019e aktar\u0131r"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
