    "Every attached model. This is what a client's model picker reads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0643\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0627\u0630\u062c \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064f\u0631\u0641\u0642\u0629. \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0645\u0627 \u062a\u0642\u0631\u0623\u0647 \u0642\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u062e\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0627\u0630\u062c \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u064a\u0644."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle verbundenen Modelle. Das liest die Modellauswahl eines Clients."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every attached model. This is what a client's model picker reads."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todos los modelos adjuntos. Es lo que lee el selector de modelos de un cliente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les mod\u00e8les joints. C'est ce que lit le s\u00e9lecteur de mod\u00e8les d'un client."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05db\u05dc \u05d4\u05de\u05d5\u05d3\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05d4\u05de\u05e6\u05d5\u05e8\u05e4\u05d9\u05dd. \u05d6\u05d4 \u05de\u05d4 \u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05e8\u05e8 \u05d4\u05de\u05d5\u05d3\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05e9\u05dc \u05dc\u05e7\u05d5\u05d7 \u05e7\u05d5\u05e8\u05d0."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u092d\u0940 \u0938\u0902\u0932\u0917\u094d\u0928 \u092e\u0949\u0921\u0932\u0964 \u0915\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0902\u091f \u0915\u093e \u092e\u0949\u0921\u0932 \u092a\u093f\u0915\u0930 \u092f\u0939\u0940 \u092a\u0922\u093c\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semua model terlampir. Inilah yang dibaca pemilih model klien."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tutti i modelli collegati. \u00c8 ci\u00f2 che legge il selettore di modelli di un client."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u63a5\u7d9a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3002\u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30a2\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u9078\u629e\u306f\u3053\u308c\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u53d6\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc5f0\uacb0\ub41c \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ubaa8\ub378. \ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\uc758 \ubaa8\ub378 \uc120\ud0dd\uae30\uac00 \uc77d\ub294 \ubaa9\ub85d\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle gekoppelde modellen. Dit leest de modelkiezer van een client."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wszystkie do\u0142\u0105czone modele. T\u0119 list\u0119 odczytuje selektor modeli klienta."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todos os modelos anexados. \u00c9 o que o seletor de modelos de um cliente l\u00ea."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0441\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0451\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438. \u042d\u0442\u043e \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0441\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043e\u043a \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0439 \u0432 \u043a\u043b\u0438\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0435."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alla anslutna modeller. Det h\u00e4r l\u00e4ser en klients modellv\u00e4ljare."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ba\u011fl\u0131 t\u00fcm modeller. Bir istemcinin model se\u00e7icisi bunu okur."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u0441\u0456 \u043f\u0456\u0434\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0456 \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0456. \u0421\u0430\u043c\u0435 \u0446\u0435 \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0454 \u0432\u0438\u0431\u0456\u0440 \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0439 \u0443 \u043a\u043b\u0456\u0454\u043d\u0442\u0456."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M\u1ecdi m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eafn. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 danh s\u00e1ch b\u1ed9 ch\u1ecdn m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6240\u6709\u5df2\u6302\u8f7d\u7684\u6a21\u578b\u3002\u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\u7684\u6a21\u578b\u9009\u62e9\u5668\u8bfb\u53d6\u7684\u5c31\u662f\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6240\u6709\u5df2\u639b\u8f09\u7684\u6a21\u578b\u3002\u7528\u6236\u7aef\u7684\u6a21\u578b\u9078\u64c7\u5668\u8b80\u53d6\u7684\u5c31\u662f\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
