    "Fan speed via ThermalForge. Click to pin max or restore the automatic curve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0633\u0631\u0639\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0648\u062d\u0629 \u0639\u0628\u0631 ThermalForge. \u0627\u0646\u0642\u0631 \u0644\u062a\u062b\u0628\u064a\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062d\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0642\u0635\u0649 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062d\u0646\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L\u00fcftergeschwindigkeit \u00fcber ThermalForge. Klicken, um das Maximum anzuheften oder die automatische Kurve wiederherzustellen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fan speed via ThermalForge. Click to pin max or restore the automatic curve."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Velocidad del ventilador mediante ThermalForge. Haz clic para fijar al m\u00e1ximo o restaurar la curva autom\u00e1tica."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vitesse des ventilateurs via ThermalForge. Cliquez pour \u00e9pingler au maximum ou r\u00e9tablir la courbe automatique."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05de\u05d4\u05d9\u05e8\u05d5\u05ea \u05d4\u05de\u05d0\u05d5\u05d5\u05e8\u05e8 \u05d3\u05e8\u05da ThermalForge. \u05dc\u05d7\u05e5 \u05db\u05d3\u05d9 \u05dc\u05d4\u05e6\u05de\u05d9\u05d3 \u05dc\u05de\u05e7\u05e1\u05d9\u05de\u05d5\u05dd \u05d0\u05d5 \u05dc\u05e9\u05d7\u05d6\u05e8 \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05e2\u05e7\u05d5\u05de\u05d4 \u05d4\u05d0\u05d5\u05d8\u05d5\u05de\u05d8\u05d9\u05ea."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThermalForge \u0915\u0947 \u091c\u093c\u0930\u093f\u090f \u092a\u0902\u0916\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0917\u0924\u093f\u0964 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915\u0924\u092e \u092a\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u092f\u093e \u0938\u094d\u0935\u091a\u093e\u0932\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u094d\u0935 \u092c\u0939\u093e\u0932 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0915\u094d\u0932\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kecepatan kipas melalui ThermalForge. Klik untuk menyematkan maksimum atau memulihkan kurva otomatis."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Velocit\u00e0 delle ventole tramite ThermalForge. Fai clic per fissarla al massimo o ripristinare la curva automatica."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThermalForge \u306b\u3088\u308b\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u901f\u5ea6\u3002\u30af\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u3057\u3066\u6700\u5927\u306b\u56fa\u5b9a\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3001\u81ea\u52d5\u30ab\u30fc\u30d6\u306b\u623b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThermalForge\ub97c \ud1b5\ud55c \ud32c \uc18d\ub3c4\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ud074\ub9ad\ud558\uc5ec \ucd5c\ub300\ub85c \uace0\uc815\ud558\uac70\ub098 \uc790\ub3d9 \uace1\uc120\uc744 \ubcf5\uc6d0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ventilatorsnelheid via ThermalForge. Klik om op maximum vast te zetten of de automatische curve te herstellen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pr\u0119dko\u015b\u0107 wentylator\u00f3w przez ThermalForge. Kliknij, aby przypi\u0105\u0107 maksimum lub przywr\u00f3ci\u0107 automatyczn\u0105 krzyw\u0105."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Velocidade das ventoinhas via ThermalForge. Clique para fixar no m\u00e1ximo ou restaurar a curva autom\u00e1tica."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u043b\u044f\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0432 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 ThermalForge. \u041d\u0430\u0436\u043c\u0438\u0442\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0437\u0430\u043a\u0440\u0435\u043f\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043c\u0430\u043a\u0441\u0438\u043c\u0443\u043c \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0443\u0442\u044c \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0443\u044e \u043a\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0443\u044e."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fl\u00e4kthastighet via ThermalForge. Klicka f\u00f6r att f\u00e4sta max eller \u00e5terst\u00e4lla den automatiska kurvan."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThermalForge ile fan h\u0131z\u0131. Maksimumu sabitlemek veya otomatik e\u011friyi geri y\u00fcklemek i\u00e7in t\u0131klay\u0131n."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0428\u0432\u0438\u0434\u043a\u0456\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u043b\u044f\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0456\u0432 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 ThermalForge. \u041d\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0441\u043d\u0456\u0442\u044c, \u0449\u043e\u0431 \u0437\u0430\u043a\u0440\u0456\u043f\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u043c\u0430\u043a\u0441\u0438\u043c\u0443\u043c \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0432\u0456\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u043d\u0443 \u043a\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0443."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u1ea1t qua ThermalForge. Nh\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 ghim t\u1ed1i \u0111a ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4i ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng cong t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u901a\u8fc7 ThermalForge \u663e\u793a\u98ce\u6247\u8f6c\u901f\u3002\u70b9\u6309\u53ef\u56fa\u5b9a\u4e3a\u6700\u5927\u503c\u6216\u6062\u590d\u81ea\u52a8\u66f2\u7ebf\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u900f\u904e ThermalForge \u986f\u793a\u98a8\u6247\u8f49\u901f\u3002\u6309\u4e00\u4e0b\u53ef\u56fa\u5b9a\u70ba\u6700\u5927\u503c\u6216\u6062\u5fa9\u81ea\u52d5\u66f2\u7dda\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For tools that only speak Ollama. Streams NDJSON, not SSE.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0644\u0644\u0623\u062f\u0648\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u0644\u0627 \u062a\u062a\u0639\u0627\u0645\u0644 \u0625\u0644\u0627 \u0645\u0639 Ollama. \u062a\u0628\u062b NDJSON \u0648\u0644\u064a\u0633 SSE."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F\u00fcr Werkzeuge, die nur Ollama sprechen. Streamt NDJSON, nicht SSE."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For tools that only speak Ollama. Streams NDJSON, not SSE."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para herramientas que solo hablan Ollama. Transmite NDJSON, no SSE."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour les outils qui ne parlent qu'Ollama. Diffuse du NDJSON, pas du SSE."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05dc\u05db\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05e9\u05de\u05d3\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9\u05dd \u05e8\u05e7 Ollama. \u05de\u05e9\u05d3\u05e8 NDJSON \u05d5\u05dc\u05d0 SSE."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0909\u0928 \u091f\u0942\u0932 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u091c\u094b \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 Ollama \u0938\u092e\u091d\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 SSE \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, NDJSON \u0938\u094d\u091f\u094d\u0930\u0940\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Untuk alat yang hanya mendukung Ollama. Streaming NDJSON, bukan SSE."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per gli strumenti che parlano solo Ollama. Trasmette NDJSON, non SSE."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ollama \u306e\u307f\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308b\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u5411\u3051\u3002SSE \u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f NDJSON \u3067\u30b9\u30c8\u30ea\u30fc\u30df\u30f3\u30b0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ollama\ub9cc \uc9c0\uc6d0\ud558\ub294 \ub3c4\uad6c\uc6a9. SSE\uac00 \uc544\ub2cc NDJSON\uc73c\ub85c \uc2a4\ud2b8\ub9ac\ubc0d\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voor tools die alleen Ollama spreken. Streamt NDJSON, geen SSE."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dla narz\u0119dzi obs\u0142uguj\u0105cych tylko Ollama. Strumieniuje NDJSON, nie SSE."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para ferramentas que s\u00f3 falam Ollama. Transmite NDJSON, n\u00e3o SSE."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0414\u043b\u044f \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u043e\u0432, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e Ollama. \u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u0451\u0442 NDJSON, \u0430 \u043d\u0435 SSE."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F\u00f6r verktyg som bara talar Ollama. Str\u00f6mmar NDJSON, inte SSE."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yaln\u0131zca Ollama konu\u015fan ara\u00e7lar i\u00e7in. SSE de\u011fil, NDJSON ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 yapar."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0414\u043b\u044f \u0456\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0456\u0432, \u0449\u043e \u0440\u043e\u0437\u0443\u043c\u0456\u044e\u0442\u044c \u043b\u0438\u0448\u0435 Ollama. \u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u0454 NDJSON, \u0430 \u043d\u0435 SSE."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cho c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ch\u1ec9 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 Ollama. Truy\u1ec1n NDJSON, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i SSE."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9002\u7528\u4e8e\u53ea\u652f\u6301 Ollama \u7684\u5de5\u5177\u3002\u6d41\u5f0f\u8fd4\u56de NDJSON\uff0c\u800c\u975e SSE\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9069\u7528\u65bc\u53ea\u652f\u63f4 Ollama \u7684\u5de5\u5177\u3002\u4e32\u6d41\u50b3\u56de NDJSON\uff0c\u800c\u975e SSE\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
