    "Native, so Claude Code and other Anthropic clients need no proxy in between.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0645\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0641\u0642 \u0623\u0635\u0644\u064b\u0627\u060c \u0644\u0630\u0627 \u0644\u0627 \u064a\u062d\u062a\u0627\u062c Claude Code \u0648\u0639\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0621 Anthropic \u0627\u0644\u0622\u062e\u0631\u0648\u0646 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0648\u0633\u064a\u0637."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nativ, sodass Claude Code und andere Anthropic-Clients keinen Proxy dazwischen brauchen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native, so Claude Code and other Anthropic clients need no proxy in between."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nativo, as\u00ed que Claude Code y otros clientes de Anthropic no necesitan un proxy intermedio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Natif : Claude Code et les autres clients Anthropic n'ont besoin d'aucun proxy interm\u00e9diaire."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05de\u05e7\u05d5\u05e8\u05d9, \u05db\u05da \u05e9-Claude Code \u05d5\u05dc\u05e7\u05d5\u05d7\u05d5\u05ea Anthropic \u05d0\u05d7\u05e8\u05d9\u05dd \u05d0\u05d9\u05e0\u05dd \u05e6\u05e8\u05d9\u05db\u05d9\u05dd \u05e9\u05e8\u05ea \u05d1\u05d9\u05e0\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0928\u0947\u091f\u093f\u0935, \u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f Claude Code \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f Anthropic \u0915\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0902\u091f \u0915\u094b \u092c\u0940\u091a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0915\u094d\u0938\u0940 \u0915\u0940 \u091c\u093c\u0930\u0942\u0930\u0924 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native, jadi Claude Code dan klien Anthropic lain tidak memerlukan proxy di antaranya."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nativo, quindi Claude Code e gli altri client Anthropic non richiedono un proxy intermedio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u5bfe\u5fdc\u306e\u305f\u3081\u3001Claude Code \u306a\u3069\u306e Anthropic \u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30a2\u30f3\u30c8\u306f\u9593\u306b\u30d7\u30ed\u30ad\u30b7\u3092\u631f\u3080\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub124\uc774\ud2f0\ube0c\ub77c\uc11c Claude Code \ubc0f \uae30\ud0c0 Anthropic \ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\uc5d0 \uc911\uac04 \ud504\ub85d\uc2dc\uac00 \ud544\uc694 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native, dus Claude Code en andere Anthropic-clients hebben geen proxy ertussen nodig."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Natywnie, wi\u0119c Claude Code i inni klienci Anthropic nie potrzebuj\u0105 po\u015brednicz\u0105cego proxy."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nativo, ent\u00e3o o Claude Code e outros clientes Anthropic n\u00e3o precisam de proxy intermedi\u00e1rio."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u043e, \u043f\u043e\u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 Claude Code \u0438 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u043c \u043a\u043b\u0438\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043c Anthropic \u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043c\u0435\u0436\u0443\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0441\u0438."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nativt, s\u00e5 Claude Code och andra Anthropic-klienter beh\u00f6ver ingen proxy emellan."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yerel destek; Claude Code ve di\u011fer Anthropic istemcileri arada vekil sunucuya ihtiya\u00e7 duymaz."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u043e, \u0442\u043e\u0436 Claude Code \u0442\u0430 \u0456\u043d\u0448\u0438\u043c \u043a\u043b\u0456\u0454\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043c Anthropic \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0456\u0431\u0435\u043d \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043c\u0456\u0436\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0441\u0456."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 g\u1ed1c n\u00ean Claude Code v\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng kh\u00e1ch Anthropic kh\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n proxy trung gian."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u539f\u751f\u652f\u6301\uff0cClaude Code \u53ca\u5176\u4ed6 Anthropic \u5ba2\u6237\u7aef\u65e0\u9700\u4e2d\u95f4\u4ee3\u7406\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u539f\u751f\u652f\u63f4\uff0cClaude Code \u53ca\u5176\u4ed6 Anthropic \u7528\u6236\u7aef\u7121\u9700\u4e2d\u9593\u4ee3\u7406\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs more memory than this Mac has, with this model loaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u064a\u062d\u062a\u0627\u062c \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631\u0629 \u0623\u0643\u062b\u0631 \u0645\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u062a\u0648\u0641\u0631 \u0641\u064a \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0640 Mac \u0645\u0639 \u062a\u062d\u0645\u064a\u0644 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0648\u0630\u062c."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ben\u00f6tigt mit diesem geladenen Modell mehr Arbeitsspeicher, als dieser Mac hat."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs more memory than this Mac has, with this model loaded."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesita m\u00e1s memoria de la que tiene este Mac con este modelo cargado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N\u00e9cessite plus de m\u00e9moire que ce Mac n'en dispose avec ce mod\u00e8le charg\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d3\u05d5\u05e8\u05e9 \u05d9\u05d5\u05ea\u05e8 \u05d6\u05d9\u05db\u05e8\u05d5\u05df \u05de\u05de\u05d4 \u05e9\u05d9\u05e9 \u05d1-Mac \u05d4\u05d6\u05d4 \u05db\u05e9\u05d4\u05de\u05d5\u05d3\u05dc \u05d4\u05d6\u05d4 \u05d8\u05e2\u05d5\u05df."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0907\u0938 \u092e\u0949\u0921\u0932 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u094b\u0921 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u0907\u0938 Mac \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0909\u092a\u0932\u092c\u094d\u0927 \u092e\u0947\u092e\u094b\u0930\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u0940 \u0906\u0935\u0936\u094d\u092f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Membutuhkan lebih banyak memori daripada yang dimiliki Mac ini saat model ini dimuat."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Richiede pi\u00f9 memoria di quella disponibile su questo Mac con questo modello caricato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3053\u306e\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u3093\u3060\u72b6\u614b\u3067\u306f\u3001\u3053\u306eMac\u306e\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u304c\u4e0d\u8db3\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc774 \ubaa8\ub378\uc744 \ub85c\ub4dc\ud55c \uc0c1\ud0dc\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 \uc774 Mac\uc758 \uba54\ubaa8\ub9ac\ubcf4\ub2e4 \ub354 \ub9ce\uc740 \uba54\ubaa8\ub9ac\uac00 \ud544\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heeft met dit model geladen meer geheugen nodig dan deze Mac heeft."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wymaga wi\u0119cej pami\u0119ci, ni\u017c ma ten Mac przy za\u0142adowanym modelu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precisa de mais mem\u00f3ria do que este Mac tem com este modelo carregado."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043f\u0430\u043c\u044f\u0442\u0438, \u0447\u0435\u043c \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c Mac \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u0437\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kr\u00e4ver mer minne \u00e4n den h\u00e4r Mac-datorn har med den h\u00e4r modellen inl\u00e4st."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu model y\u00fckl\u00fcyken bu Mac'te bulunandan daha fazla bellek gerekir."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0456\u0431\u043d\u043e \u0431\u0456\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043f\u0430\u043c\u2019\u044f\u0442\u0456, \u043d\u0456\u0436 \u0454 \u043d\u0430 \u0446\u044c\u043e\u043c\u0443 Mac \u0456\u0437 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043e\u044e \u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u043b\u043b\u044e."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C\u1ea7n nhi\u1ec1u b\u1ed9 nh\u1edb h\u01a1n m\u00e1y Mac n\u00e0y c\u00f3 khi \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ea3i m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh n\u00e0y."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u52a0\u8f7d\u6b64\u6a21\u578b\u540e\u6240\u9700\u5185\u5b58\u8d85\u51fa\u8fd9\u53f0 Mac \u7684\u5bb9\u91cf\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f09\u5165\u6b64\u6a21\u578b\u5f8c\u6240\u9700\u8a18\u61b6\u9ad4\u8d85\u51fa\u9019\u53f0 Mac \u7684\u5bb9\u91cf\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
