    "Opening the model: reading weights and allocating the KV cache": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u062c\u0627\u0631\u064d \u0641\u062a\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0648\u0630\u062c: \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0621\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0632\u0627\u0646 \u0648\u062a\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0635 \u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631\u0629 KV \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0624\u0642\u062a\u0629"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modell wird ge\u00f6ffnet: Gewichte werden gelesen und der KV-Cache wird zugewiesen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opening the model: reading weights and allocating the KV cache"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abriendo el modelo: leyendo pesos y asignando la cach\u00e9 KV"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouverture du mod\u00e8le : lecture des poids et allocation du cache KV"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e4\u05d5\u05ea\u05d7 \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05de\u05d5\u05d3\u05dc: \u05e7\u05d5\u05e8\u05d0 \u05de\u05e9\u05e7\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05d5\u05de\u05e7\u05e6\u05d4 \u05d0\u05ea \u05de\u05d8\u05de\u05d5\u05df \u05d4-KV"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0949\u0921\u0932 \u0916\u094b\u0932\u093e \u091c\u093e \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948: \u0935\u0947\u091f \u092a\u0922\u093c\u0947 \u091c\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0914\u0930 KV \u0915\u0948\u0936 \u0906\u0935\u0902\u091f\u093f\u0924 \u0939\u094b \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Membuka model: membaca bobot dan mengalokasikan cache KV"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apertura del modello: lettura dei pesi e allocazione della cache KV"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3092\u958b\u3044\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059: \u91cd\u307f\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u3001KV \u30ad\u30e3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u3092\u78ba\u4fdd\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubaa8\ub378\uc744 \uc5ec\ub294 \uc911: \uac00\uc911\uce58\ub97c \uc77d\uace0 KV \uce90\uc2dc\ub97c \ud560\ub2f9\ud558\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model openen: gewichten lezen en de KV-cache toewijzen"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otwieranie modelu: odczyt wag i przydzielanie pami\u0119ci podr\u0119cznej KV"
