    "Agent (classifier): a local classifier approves or blocks each call": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0648\u0643\u064a\u0644 (\u0645\u0635\u0646\u0641): \u064a\u0648\u0627\u0641\u0642 \u0645\u0635\u0646\u0641 \u0645\u062d\u0644\u064a \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0643\u0644 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u062f\u0639\u0627\u0621 \u0623\u0648 \u064a\u062d\u0638\u0631\u0647"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent (Klassifikator): Ein lokaler Klassifikator genehmigt oder blockiert jeden Aufruf"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent (classifier): a local classifier approves or blocks each call"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agente (clasificador): un clasificador local aprueba o bloquea cada llamada"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent (classificateur) : un classificateur local approuve ou bloque chaque appel"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e1\u05d5\u05db\u05df (\u05de\u05e1\u05d5\u05d5\u05d2): \u05de\u05e1\u05d5\u05d5\u05d2 \u05de\u05e7\u05d5\u05de\u05d9 \u05de\u05d0\u05e9\u05e8 \u05d0\u05d5 \u05d7\u05d5\u05e1\u05dd \u05db\u05dc \u05e7\u05e8\u05d9\u05d0\u05d4"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u090f\u091c\u0947\u0902\u091f (\u0915\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0938\u093f\u092b\u093c\u093e\u092f\u0930): \u090f\u0915 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0928\u0940\u092f \u0915\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0938\u093f\u092b\u093c\u093e\u092f\u0930 \u0939\u0930 \u0915\u0949\u0932 \u0915\u094b \u0905\u0928\u0941\u092e\u0924\u093f \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u092f\u093e \u0930\u094b\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agen (pengklasifikasi): pengklasifikasi lokal menyetujui atau memblokir setiap panggilan"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agente (classificatore): un classificatore locale approva o blocca ogni chiamata"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c8 (\u5206\u985e\u5668)\uff1a\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30eb\u306e\u5206\u985e\u5668\u304c\u5404\u547c\u3073\u51fa\u3057\u3092\u627f\u8a8d\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc5d0\uc774\uc804\ud2b8(\ubd84\ub958\uae30): \ub85c\uceec \ubd84\ub958\uae30\uac00 \uac01 \ud638\ucd9c\uc744 \uc2b9\uc778\ud558\uac70\ub098 \ucc28\ub2e8"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent (classificatie): een lokale classificatie keurt elke aanroep goed of blokkeert die"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent (klasyfikator): lokalny klasyfikator zatwierdza lub blokuje ka\u017cde wywo\u0142anie"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agente (classificador): um classificador local aprova ou bloqueia cada chamada"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442 (\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0444\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440): \u043b\u043e\u043a\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0444\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440 \u043e\u0434\u043e\u0431\u0440\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0431\u043b\u043e\u043a\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u044b\u0439 \u0432\u044b\u0437\u043e\u0432"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent (klassificerare): en lokal klassificerare godk\u00e4nner eller blockerar varje anrop"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arac\u0131 (s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131): yerel bir s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 her \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131y\u0131 onaylar veya engeller"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442 (\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0444\u0456\u043a\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440): \u043b\u043e\u043a\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0444\u0456\u043a\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440 \u0441\u0445\u0432\u0430\u043b\u044e\u0454 \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0431\u043b\u043e\u043a\u0443\u0454 \u043a\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043b\u0438\u043a"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "T\u00e1c nh\u00e2n (b\u1ed9 ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i): b\u1ed9 ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 duy\u1ec7t ho\u1eb7c ch\u1eb7n t\u1eebng l\u1ec7nh g\u1ecdi"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u7406 (\u5206\u7c7b\u5668)\uff1a\u7531\u672c\u5730\u5206\u7c7b\u5668\u6279\u51c6\u6216\u62e6\u622a\u6bcf\u6b21\u8c03\u7528"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u7406 (\u5206\u985e\u5668)\uff1a\u7531\u672c\u6a5f\u5206\u985e\u5668\u6838\u51c6\u6216\u5c01\u9396\u6bcf\u6b21\u547c\u53eb"
          }
        }
      }
    },
