        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V\u00e9rifier les fichiers AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, CONTEXT.md et SOUL.md actuels de ce projet"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d1\u05d3\u05d5\u05e7 \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05e7\u05d1\u05e6\u05d9\u05dd AGENTS.md,\u200f CLAUDE.md,\u200f CONTEXT.md \u05d5-SOUL.md \u05d4\u05e2\u05d3\u05db\u05e0\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd \u05e9\u05dc \u05d4\u05e4\u05e8\u05d5\u05d9\u05e7\u05d8"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0907\u0938 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0940 \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0924\u092e\u093e\u0928 AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, CONTEXT.md \u0914\u0930 SOUL.md \u092b\u093c\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0901\u091a\u0947\u0902"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Periksa file AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, CONTEXT.md, dan SOUL.md terkini untuk proyek ini"
