    "Kill this background shell (its child processes are killed with it)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0625\u0646\u0647\u0627\u0621 \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u062f\u0641\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0644\u0641\u064a\u0629 (\u062a\u064f\u0646\u0647\u0649 \u0639\u0645\u0644\u064a\u0627\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0631\u0639\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u0639\u0647\u0627)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Hintergrund-Shell beenden (ihre Kindprozesse werden mit beendet)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kill this background shell (its child processes are killed with it)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminar este shell en segundo plano (sus procesos hijos terminan con \u00e9l)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arr\u00eater ce shell en arri\u00e8re-plan (ses processus enfants sont arr\u00eat\u00e9s avec lui)"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e1\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05de\u05e2\u05d8\u05e4\u05ea \u05d1\u05e8\u05e7\u05e2 (\u05ea\u05d4\u05dc\u05d9\u05db\u05d9 \u05d4\u05d1\u05df \u05e9\u05dc\u05d4 \u05de\u05e1\u05ea\u05d9\u05d9\u05de\u05d9\u05dd \u05d0\u05d9\u05ea\u05d4)"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092f\u0939 \u092a\u0943\u0937\u094d\u0920\u092d\u0942\u092e\u093f \u0936\u0947\u0932 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 (\u0907\u0938\u0915\u0940 \u091a\u093e\u0907\u0932\u094d\u0921 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u092d\u0940 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0939\u094b\u0902\u0917\u0940)"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hentikan shell latar belakang ini (proses turunannya ikut dihentikan)"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Termina questa shell in background (i processi figli vengono terminati con lei)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3053\u306e\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30b0\u30e9\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9\u30b7\u30a7\u30eb\u3092\u7d42\u4e86\uff08\u5b50\u30d7\u30ed\u30bb\u30b9\u3082\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u7d42\u4e86\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff09"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
