    "Strict Read-Only: only read and search, no edits or commands": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0621\u0629 \u0641\u0642\u0637 \u0635\u0627\u0631\u0645\u0629: \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0621\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0628\u062d\u062b \u0641\u0642\u0637\u060c \u062f\u0648\u0646 \u062a\u0639\u062f\u064a\u0644\u0627\u062a \u0623\u0648 \u0623\u0648\u0627\u0645\u0631"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strikt schreibgesch\u00fctzt: nur lesen und suchen, keine \u00c4nderungen oder Befehle"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strict Read-Only: only read and search, no edits or commands"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo lectura estricta: solo leer y buscar, sin ediciones ni comandos"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lecture seule stricte : lire et rechercher uniquement, ni modifications ni commandes"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e7\u05e8\u05d9\u05d0\u05d4 \u05d1\u05dc\u05d1\u05d3 \u05de\u05d7\u05de\u05d9\u05e8\u05d4: \u05e8\u05e7 \u05e7\u05e8\u05d9\u05d0\u05d4 \u05d5\u05d7\u05d9\u05e4\u05d5\u05e9, \u05dc\u05dc\u05d0 \u05e2\u05e8\u05d9\u05db\u05d5\u05ea \u05d0\u05d5 \u05e4\u05e7\u05d5\u05d3\u05d5\u05ea"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u0916\u093c\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932-\u092a\u0922\u093c\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f: \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u092a\u0922\u093c\u0928\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0916\u094b\u091c\u0928\u093e, \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0938\u0902\u092a\u093e\u0926\u0928 \u092f\u093e \u0915\u092e\u093e\u0902\u0921 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanya Baca Ketat: hanya membaca dan mencari, tanpa edit atau perintah"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sola lettura rigorosa: solo lettura e ricerca, nessuna modifica o comando"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u53b3\u683c\u306a\u8aad\u307f\u53d6\u308a\u5c02\u7528\uff1a\u8aad\u307f\u53d6\u308a\u3068\u691c\u7d22\u306e\u307f\u3001\u7de8\u96c6\u3084\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9\u306f\u4e0d\u53ef"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc5c4\uaca9\ud55c \uc77d\uae30 \uc804\uc6a9: \uc77d\uae30\uc640 \uac80\uc0c9\ub9cc, \ud3b8\uc9d1\uc774\ub098 \uba85\ub839 \ubd88\uac00"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strikt alleen-lezen: alleen lezen en zoeken, geen wijzigingen of opdrachten"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u015acis\u0142y tylko odczyt: tylko odczyt i wyszukiwanie, bez zmian i polece\u0144"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somente Leitura Estrito: s\u00f3 ler e buscar, sem edi\u00e7\u00f5es ou comandos"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0447\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435: \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0447\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0438\u0441\u043a, \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043e\u043a \u0438 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0434"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strikt skrivskyddad: bara l\u00e4sa och s\u00f6ka, inga \u00e4ndringar eller kommandon"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kat\u0131 Salt Okunur: yaln\u0131zca okuma ve arama, d\u00fczenleme veya komut yok"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0443\u0432\u043e\u0440\u043e \u043b\u0438\u0448\u0435 \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f: \u0442\u0456\u043b\u044c\u043a\u0438 \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0448\u0443\u043a, \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0437\u043c\u0456\u043d \u0456 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0434"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecdc nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t: ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, kh\u00f4ng s\u1eeda hay ch\u1ea1y l\u1ec7nh"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e25\u683c\u53ea\u8bfb\uff1a\u53ea\u80fd\u8bfb\u53d6\u548c\u641c\u7d22\uff0c\u4e0d\u80fd\u7f16\u8f91\u6216\u6267\u884c\u547d\u4ee4"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u56b4\u683c\u552f\u8b80\uff1a\u53ea\u80fd\u8b80\u53d6\u548c\u641c\u5c0b\uff0c\u4e0d\u80fd\u7de8\u8f2f\u6216\u57f7\u884c\u6307\u4ee4"
          }
        }
      }
    },
