    "Use the up and down arrows to choose, Return to accept, Escape to dismiss.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0647\u0645\u064a\u0646 \u0644\u0623\u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0648\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0641\u0644 \u0644\u0644\u0627\u062e\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0631\u060c \u0648Return \u0644\u0644\u0642\u0628\u0648\u0644\u060c \u0648Escape \u0644\u0644\u0625\u063a\u0644\u0627\u0642."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit den Pfeiltasten nach oben und unten w\u00e4hlen, mit Return \u00fcbernehmen, mit Escape schlie\u00dfen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the up and down arrows to choose, Return to accept, Escape to dismiss."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa las flechas arriba y abajo para elegir, Retorno para aceptar y Escape para descartar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez les fl\u00e8ches haut et bas pour choisir, Retour pour accepter, \u00c9chap pour fermer."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05e9\u05ea\u05de\u05e9 \u05d1\u05d7\u05e6\u05d9\u05dd \u05dc\u05de\u05e2\u05dc\u05d4 \u05d5\u05dc\u05de\u05d8\u05d4 \u05dc\u05d1\u05d7\u05d9\u05e8\u05d4, Return \u05dc\u05d0\u05d9\u05e9\u05d5\u05e8 \u05d5-Escape \u05dc\u05e1\u05d2\u05d9\u05e8\u05d4."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u091a\u0941\u0928\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090a\u092a\u0930 \u0914\u0930 \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0924\u0940\u0930, \u0938\u094d\u0935\u0940\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f Return \u0914\u0930 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f Escape \u0926\u092c\u093e\u090f\u0901\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gunakan panah atas dan bawah untuk memilih, Return untuk menerima, Escape untuk menutup."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa le frecce su e gi\u00f9 per scegliere, A capo per accettare, Esc per chiudere."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0a\u4e0b\u77e2\u5370\u30ad\u30fc\u3067\u9078\u629e\u3001Return \u3067\u78ba\u5b9a\u3001Escape \u3067\u9589\u3058\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc704\uc544\ub798 \ud654\uc0b4\ud45c\ub85c \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uace0, Return\uc73c\ub85c \uc218\ub77d\ud558\uace0, Escape\ub85c \ub2eb\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruik de pijltjes omhoog en omlaag om te kiezen, Return om te accepteren en Escape om te sluiten."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strza\u0142ki w g\u00f3r\u0119 i w d\u00f3\u0142 wybieraj\u0105, Return akceptuje, Escape zamyka."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use as setas para cima e para baixo para escolher, Return para aceitar e Esc para fechar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043b\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0445 \u0438 \u0432\u043d\u0438\u0437 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0432\u044b\u0431\u043e\u0440\u0430, Return \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f, Escape \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0437\u0430\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0442\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anv\u00e4nd upp\u00e5t- och ned\u00e5tpilarna f\u00f6r att v\u00e4lja, Retur f\u00f6r att godk\u00e4nna och Escape f\u00f6r att st\u00e4nga."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se\u00e7mek i\u00e7in yukar\u0131 ve a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 oklar\u0131, kabul etmek i\u00e7in Return'\u00fc, kapatmak i\u00e7in Escape'i kullan\u0131n."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0442\u0440\u0456\u043b\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u0433\u043e\u0440\u0443 \u0439 \u0443\u043d\u0438\u0437 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0432\u0438\u0431\u043e\u0440\u0443, Return \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u0456\u0434\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0434\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f, Escape \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0437\u0430\u043a\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0442\u044f."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D\u00f9ng ph\u00edm m\u0169i t\u00ean l\u00ean v\u00e0 xu\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn, Return \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn, Escape \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00f3ng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7528\u4e0a\u4e0b\u65b9\u5411\u952e\u9009\u62e9\uff0c\u6309 Return \u786e\u8ba4\uff0c\u6309 Escape \u5173\u95ed\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7528\u4e0a\u4e0b\u65b9\u5411\u9375\u9078\u64c7\uff0c\u6309 Return \u78ba\u8a8d\uff0c\u6309 Escape \u95dc\u9589\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User-configured agent with customized system instructions and tool capabilities.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0648\u0643\u064a\u0644 \u064a\u0636\u0628\u0637\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0645 \u0628\u062a\u0639\u0644\u064a\u0645\u0627\u062a \u0646\u0638\u0627\u0645 \u0648\u0642\u062f\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0623\u062f\u0648\u0627\u062a \u0645\u062e\u0635\u0635\u0629."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vom Benutzer konfigurierter Agent mit eigenen Systemanweisungen und Werkzeugf\u00e4higkeiten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "User-configured agent with customized system instructions and tool capabilities."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agente configurado por el usuario con instrucciones de sistema y herramientas personalizadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent configur\u00e9 par l'utilisateur, avec des instructions syst\u00e8me et des outils personnalis\u00e9s."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e1\u05d5\u05db\u05df \u05e9\u05d4\u05de\u05e9\u05ea\u05de\u05e9 \u05de\u05d2\u05d3\u05d9\u05e8, \u05e2\u05dd \u05d4\u05d5\u05e8\u05d0\u05d5\u05ea \u05de\u05e2\u05e8\u05db\u05ea \u05d5\u05d9\u05db\u05d5\u05dc\u05d5\u05ea \u05db\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05de\u05d5\u05ea\u05d0\u05de\u05d5\u05ea."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917\u0915\u0930\u094d\u0924\u093e \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0949\u0928\u094d\u092b\u093c\u093f\u0917\u0930 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e \u090f\u091c\u0947\u0902\u091f, \u0915\u0938\u094d\u091f\u092e \u0938\u093f\u0938\u094d\u091f\u092e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u0926\u0947\u0936\u094b\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u091f\u0942\u0932 \u0915\u094d\u0937\u092e\u0924\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agen yang dikonfigurasi pengguna dengan instruksi sistem dan kemampuan alat khusus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agente configurato dall'utente con istruzioni di sistema e strumenti personalizzati."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u6307\u793a\u3068\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u6a5f\u80fd\u3092\u30ab\u30b9\u30bf\u30de\u30a4\u30ba\u3057\u305f\u3001\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306e\u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c8\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc2dc\uc2a4\ud15c \uc9c0\uce68\uacfc \ub3c4\uad6c \uae30\ub2a5\uc744 \uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\uac00 \uc9c1\uc811 \uad6c\uc131\ud55c \uc5d0\uc774\uc804\ud2b8."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Door de gebruiker ingestelde agent met eigen systeeminstructies en toolmogelijkheden."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent skonfigurowany przez u\u017cytkownika z w\u0142asnymi instrukcjami systemowymi i narz\u0119dziami."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agente configurado pelo usu\u00e1rio com instru\u00e7\u00f5es de sistema e ferramentas personalizadas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442, \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u043c, \u0441 \u0441\u043e\u0431\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043c\u043d\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f\u043c\u0438 \u0438 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043c\u0438."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anv\u00e4ndarkonfigurerad agent med egna systeminstruktioner och verktygsf\u00f6rm\u00e5gor."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00d6zelle\u015ftirilmi\u015f sistem talimatlar\u0131 ve ara\u00e7 yetenekleriyle kullan\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lan ajan."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442, \u043d\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0443\u0432\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043c, \u0456\u0437 \u0432\u043b\u0430\u0441\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043c\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0456\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043a\u0446\u0456\u044f\u043c\u0438 \u0442\u0430 \u0456\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043c\u0438."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "T\u00e1c t\u1eed do ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh v\u1edbi ch\u1ec9 d\u1eabn h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7531\u7528\u6237\u914d\u7f6e\u7684\u4ee3\u7406\uff0c\u5e26\u6709\u81ea\u5b9a\u4e49\u7cfb\u7edf\u6307\u4ee4\u548c\u5de5\u5177\u80fd\u529b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7531\u4f7f\u7528\u8005\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7684\u4ee3\u7406\uff0c\u5e36\u6709\u81ea\u8a02\u7cfb\u7d71\u6307\u793a\u548c\u5de5\u5177\u80fd\u529b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Versatile conversational assistant with optional tool usage when requested.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f \u0645\u062d\u0627\u062f\u062b\u0629 \u0645\u062a\u0639\u062f\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0627\u0645\u0627\u062a \u064a\u0633\u062a\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062f\u0648\u0627\u062a \u0639\u0646\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0644\u0628."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vielseitiger Gespr\u00e4chsassistent, der auf Wunsch Werkzeuge nutzt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Versatile conversational assistant with optional tool usage when requested."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asistente conversacional vers\u00e1til que usa herramientas cuando se le pide."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assistant conversationnel polyvalent qui utilise des outils sur demande."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e2\u05d5\u05d6\u05e8 \u05e9\u05d9\u05d7\u05d4 \u05e8\u05d1-\u05ea\u05db\u05dc\u05d9\u05ea\u05d9 \u05d4\u05de\u05e9\u05ea\u05de\u05e9 \u05d1\u05db\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05dc\u05e4\u05d9 \u05d1\u05e7\u05e9\u05d4."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092c\u0939\u0941\u092e\u0941\u0916\u0940 \u0938\u0902\u0935\u093e\u0926 \u0938\u0939\u093e\u092f\u0915, \u091c\u094b \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0930\u094b\u0927 \u092a\u0930 \u091f\u0942\u0932 \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asisten percakapan serbaguna yang memakai alat bila diminta."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assistente conversazionale versatile che usa strumenti su richiesta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5fc5\u8981\u306b\u5fdc\u3058\u3066\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u3082\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u591a\u76ee\u7684\u306a\u5bfe\u8a71\u30a2\u30b7\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30c8\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc694\uccad \uc2dc \ub3c4\uad6c\ub3c4 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud558\ub294 \ub2e4\uc7ac\ub2e4\ub2a5\ud55c \ub300\ud654\ud615 \uc5b4\uc2dc\uc2a4\ud134\ud2b8."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veelzijdige gespreksassistent die op verzoek tools gebruikt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wszechstronny asystent rozmowy, kt\u00f3ry na \u017cyczenie korzysta z narz\u0119dzi."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assistente de conversa vers\u00e1til que usa ferramentas quando solicitado."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u043d\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0430\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0431\u0435\u0441\u0435\u0434, \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u044e\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b \u043f\u043e \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0443."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M\u00e5ngsidig samtalsassistent som anv\u00e4nder verktyg vid behov."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130stendi\u011finde ara\u00e7 kullanan \u00e7ok y\u00f6nl\u00fc bir sohbet asistan\u0131."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u043d\u0456\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0430\u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0440\u043e\u0437\u043c\u043e\u0432, \u0449\u043e \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0443\u0454 \u0456\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0442."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tr\u1ee3 l\u00fd tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n \u0111a n\u0103ng, d\u00f9ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u591a\u7528\u9014\u5bf9\u8bdd\u52a9\u624b\uff0c\u6309\u9700\u4f7f\u7528\u5de5\u5177\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u591a\u7528\u9014\u5c0d\u8a71\u52a9\u7406\uff0c\u6309\u9700\u4f7f\u7528\u5de5\u5177\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
