    "Persist an allow rule for this MCP tool or server in project settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u062d\u0641\u0638 \u0642\u0627\u0639\u062f\u0629 \u0633\u0645\u0627\u062d \u0644\u0623\u062f\u0627\u0629 MCP \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0623\u0648 \u062e\u0627\u062f\u0645\u0647\u0627 \u0641\u064a \u0625\u0639\u062f\u0627\u062f\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Erlaubnisregel f\u00fcr dieses MCP-Tool oder diesen Server in den Projekteinstellungen speichern"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Persist an allow rule for this MCP tool or server in project settings"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guardar una regla de permiso para esta herramienta o servidor MCP en los ajustes del proyecto"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enregistrer une r\u00e8gle d'autorisation pour cet outil ou ce serveur MCP dans les r\u00e9glages du projet"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05e9\u05de\u05d5\u05e8 \u05db\u05dc\u05dc \u05d4\u05e8\u05e9\u05d0\u05d4 \u05dc\u05db\u05dc\u05d9 \u05d0\u05d5 \u05dc\u05e9\u05e8\u05ea \u05d4-MCP \u05d4\u05d6\u05d4 \u05d1\u05d4\u05d2\u05d3\u05e8\u05d5\u05ea \u05d4\u05e4\u05e8\u05d5\u05d9\u05e7\u05d8"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0907\u0938 MCP \u091f\u0942\u0932 \u092f\u093e \u0938\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0938\u0947\u091f\u093f\u0902\u0917\u094d\u0938 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u092e\u0924\u093f \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0938\u0939\u0947\u091c\u0947\u0902"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simpan aturan izin untuk alat atau server MCP ini di pengaturan proyek"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salva una regola di autorizzazione per questo strumento o server MCP nelle impostazioni del progetto"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3053\u306e MCP \u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u306e\u8a31\u53ef\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306b\u4fdd\u5b58"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc774 MCP \ub3c4\uad6c \ub610\ub294 \uc11c\ubc84\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ud5c8\uc6a9 \uaddc\uce59\uc744 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8 \uc124\uc815\uc5d0 \uc800\uc7a5"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een toestemmingsregel voor deze MCP-tool of -server opslaan in de projectinstellingen"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zapisz regu\u0142\u0119 zezwalaj\u0105c\u0105 dla tego narz\u0119dzia lub serwera MCP w ustawieniach projektu"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salvar uma regra de permiss\u00e3o para esta ferramenta ou servidor MCP nas configura\u00e7\u00f5es do projeto"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0435\u0448\u0430\u044e\u0449\u0435\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u043e \u0434\u043b\u044f \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430 MCP \u0432 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0430\u0445 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0430"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spara en till\u00e5telseregel f\u00f6r det h\u00e4r MCP-verktyget eller servern i projektinst\u00e4llningarna"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu MCP arac\u0131 veya sunucusu i\u00e7in proje ayarlar\u0131na bir izin kural\u0131 kaydet"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u0442\u0438 \u0434\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0456\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u043e \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0446\u044c\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0456\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430 \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430 MCP \u0443 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0442\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f\u0445 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0454\u043a\u0442\u0443"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L\u01b0u quy t\u1eafc cho ph\u00e9p cho c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ho\u1eb7c m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7 MCP n\u00e0y trong c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t d\u1ef1 \u00e1n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u9879\u76ee\u8bbe\u7f6e\u4e2d\u4e3a\u6b64 MCP \u5de5\u5177\u6216\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u4fdd\u5b58\u5141\u8bb8\u89c4\u5219"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u5c08\u6848\u8a2d\u5b9a\u4e2d\u70ba\u6b64 MCP \u5de5\u5177\u6216\u4f3a\u670d\u5668\u5132\u5b58\u5141\u8a31\u898f\u5247"
          }
